{"time": 1751993893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1041696416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（然后呢[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1751993959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062097720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我只要一半...”"}
{"time": 1751994289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1630009644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不..我完全没有参与那条龙的讨伐。\""}
{"time": 1751994303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1730365801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（尬黑）"}
{"time": 1751994324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1848643918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还是露儿拿走吧。\""}
{"time": 1751994441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "425785831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"而且，露儿现在花钱很快吧。\""}
{"time": 1751994462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1452507007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....谢谢安姐姐”"}
{"time": 1751994605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595936914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，没事啦。\""}
{"time": 1751994676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "916716691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这样吧）"}
{"time": 1751994683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1851319080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+6 夏弥侦查"}
{"time": 1751994683, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1851319080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]使用[夏弥侦查]演奏出:[1D20+6={20}+6=26]"}
{"time": 1751994691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "110423934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那很会侦查了）"}
{"time": 1751994704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1686586053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+2 沧澜侦查"}
{"time": 1751994704, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1686586053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]使用[沧澜侦查]演奏出:[1D20+2={11}+2=13]"}
{"time": 1751994735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "118474266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我们还没吃过饭，露儿要一起吗\""}
{"time": 1751994769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1058247133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯？”夏弥抬头，略微多看了沧澜一眼，最后视线停留在她的右侧身子上"}
{"time": 1751994806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1979240850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "沧澜也抬起头，嗅着什么“怎么有股血味……”"}
{"time": 1751994971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "82320114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我刚刚吃过了”"}
{"time": 1751994981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "54079878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“晚饭在一起吧，如果任务顺利的话”"}
{"time": 1751995013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1225664397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，做什么任务?\""}
{"time": 1751995116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1981382102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“捕获夜鸟，感觉难度还行”"}
{"time": 1751995178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1734461140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦...露儿小心一下它的尖嘴。\""}
{"time": 1751995184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1345810046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那我就准备吃饭了?\""}
{"time": 1751995234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1512257464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯，再见了安姐姐”"}
{"time": 1751995247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "892854959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你还是过个怪物常识吧（）"}
{"time": 1751995254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1375017265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（夜鸟和尖嘴有什么关系（）"}
{"time": 1751995374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1036255799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(哦猫头鹰)"}
{"time": 1751995391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1511019382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"拜拜，晚上见啦，我请大家吃饭。\""}
{"time": 1751995457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1059907121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我来请吧，毕竟人鱼龙那个任务给了好多钱”"}
{"time": 1751995570, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946532631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我会定好餐等你的。\"笑一笑，把钥匙递给绘梨衣，\"我们也吃饭吧。\""}
{"time": 1751995693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122410449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=946532631]“……”她沉默地接过钥匙，放在掌心打量着"}
{"time": 1751995753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1201347770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你的房间，嗯..在这边的话不要暴露自己的身份，就当自己是普通人。\"小声，指着屏风后的餐桌，\"坐吧。\"说完就拉着夏弥先落座。"}
{"time": 1751995996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402444783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1059907121]（你呢）"}
{"time": 1751996143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452233526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1201347770]你和夏弥落了座。绘梨衣拿着钥匙，只是站到桌边，并不落座——大概臀部与腿部还有血口子"}
{"time": 1751996149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123183904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 睡着了？）"}
{"time": 1751996153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779231892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（没）"}
{"time": 1751996180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689289085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "带着沧澜做任务去喽"}
{"time": 1751996181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337074749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1979240850]（怎么根本没人理我，哎）"}
{"time": 1751996208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159185987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有什么好说的我)"}
{"time": 1751996338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "375423692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1689289085]（那过个幸运吧）"}
{"time": 1751996376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499934155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=452233526]“安”夏弥开口“那个沧澜，似乎有些不一般”"}
{"time": 1751996438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1386642712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么了?\"看着绘梨衣的样子，给她找来一个软垫"}
{"time": 1751996501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "489095402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd+1 幸运"}
{"time": 1751996501, "type": "reply", "message_id": "489095402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[露儿]使用[幸运]演奏出:[1D20+1={6}+1=7]"}
{"time": 1751996539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1360356404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“侧身有一道很长的伤痕，看起来是新伤。不过看起来，她似乎受影响有限”"}
{"time": 1751996574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1965320135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……不过最主要的是，眼睛是竖瞳……我们猜测过的吧？”"}
{"time": 1751996582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "217095752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我知道。\""}
{"time": 1751996588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1292965745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"是那只海龙吗\""}
{"time": 1751996736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864699426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=489095402]沿海的天色依旧阴郁，此时日渐西斜，更是暮色沉沉，连带着涛声都有些唬人。而夜鸟——并不在先前你发现的巢穴里，应该是出去了"}
{"time": 1751996760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338561179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1292965745]“我不知道，海里的生物我了解不多”"}
{"time": 1751996821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "849481603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“但如果是海龙的话……”夏弥顿了顿“是什么存在能伤到她？”"}
{"time": 1751996881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2095329631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=864699426]（走过去都傍晚了？[CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1751996890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308888312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（看样子不能和安一起吃饭了）"}
{"time": 1751996894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1832728217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没有啊）"}
{"time": 1751996901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1266027819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（就这天色）"}
{"time": 1751996916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172384457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我也不太清楚...\"把软垫给绘梨衣垫下"}
{"time": 1751997043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1681013028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，不在巢穴吗”"}
{"time": 1751997063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944331925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=172384457]“……”绘梨衣看了你一眼，尝试性地坐了下去，但没多久又站了起来。菜品上来后，也只能端着碗吃"}
{"time": 1751997070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "713069466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看周围有没有什么痕迹"}
{"time": 1751997077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144682891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那天不是找到了两个存在吗？\""}
{"time": 1751997091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "854552822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=713069466]（飞的能有什么痕迹）"}
{"time": 1751997101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1915891134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不知道啊）"}
{"time": 1751997107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "524626514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一边小口吃饭一边跟夏弥说话，\"也许就是那个东西做的。\""}
{"time": 1751997122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "826598312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=713069466]至少没有争斗的痕迹"}
{"time": 1751997123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569408741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是...除了她自己，没人知道吧\""}
{"time": 1751997127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "466640418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那鸟不在家该怎么办呢，好像只能在这等了...沧澜你怎么看”"}
{"time": 1751997242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1266083936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1569408741]“嗯……空气越来越潮湿了，也不知道究竟是哪一方发力更多”夏弥不无担心地道"}
{"time": 1751997324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "439101222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=466640418]“既然有巢穴，就总会回来的”沧澜似乎有些心不在焉，她拨开碍事的枝叶，朝着更南边，那涛声阵阵的大海望去"}
{"time": 1751997347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "232816086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你不会还想去海里吧..”"}
{"time": 1751997471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "80518694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=232816086]“现在这个样子……应该不会被发现”她的身躯转眼之间已经披上甲胄"}
{"time": 1751997511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025467022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎哎哎，你受伤这么重...不准走”"}
{"time": 1751997561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2112533071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1266083936]\"还有山上那位...这里估计会不怎么太平\""}
{"time": 1751997696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1075944249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=524626514]你们聊天的空当，绘梨衣已经把第一碗饭就着乳白色的鱼汤“喝”了下去。或许是因为热量，面色总算红润了些。补完水后，便立刻把注意力放在更大块的肉食上——明明看着动作不快，只是流畅，但座位前的骨头就是比你和夏弥加起来都多"}
{"time": 1751997840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710863530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "双臂展开，拦住她"}
{"time": 1751997847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1111548531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"喊前台再加一点菜，继续对夏弥开口，\"不过，我觉得学会那边估计也不是毫无察觉，要不要待会去那边看看消息。\""}
{"time": 1751997875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1239167388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"也许会有一些有用的线索。\""}
{"time": 1751997918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253494006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2025467022]“……我知道。我打不过它，哪怕是我还没受伤的时候”沧澜撇了撇嘴“甚至没法给它留下像样的伤痕……我只是想，再稍微游一回”"}
{"time": 1751997956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1729476685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果...你非要去的话，那我也要去”"}
{"time": 1751997956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1533221050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“要用这具身体感受一下浪潮……不然我会忘记海和它的感觉的”"}
{"time": 1751998028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1947103271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是其实，海龙的身体不需要保湿，还是用肺呼吸）"}
{"time": 1751998055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "781804109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不能让你一个人过去，总之”"}
{"time": 1751998063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "658217592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（只能说在海里动作确实会灵敏很多吧，但是不刚需）"}
{"time": 1751998106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1034275944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不刚需)"}
{"time": 1751998120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1268270737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(本来就可以在陆地上狩猎)"}
{"time": 1751998125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1885431428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(随便上岸啦)"}
{"time": 1751998134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2622953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(还有董凤龙大人)"}
{"time": 1751998156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1266262137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1239167388]“希望吧……最好不会在这里久留”"}
{"time": 1751998179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "740660540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（限制海龙的其实主要是体重，所以在岸上不方便）"}
{"time": 1751998196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64962529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是人了就没这个担忧了）"}
{"time": 1751998205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2022420687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=64962529]（变成人（）"}
{"time": 1751998220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "675787837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=781804109]“为什么？”"}
{"time": 1751998220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573832051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（海龙材料做武器是+几）"}
{"time": 1751998224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1036745962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（+5吗）"}
{"time": 1751998232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "427787936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（+4顶天了）"}
{"time": 1751998240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "491923787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“万一你忽然上头了，我还能拉住你”"}
{"time": 1751998254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396305618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1266262137]\"嗯...虽然说是这么说，但是目前还没到离开的时候。\"皱着眉，\"希望那些个体之间不会起冲突。\""}
{"time": 1751998357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1297281635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=491923787]“第一，你拉不住我。第二……和你……”沧澜的手指竖到第二根的时候停住了“算了，我不去就是了”"}
{"time": 1751998453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099813836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“沧澜人最好了”开心的两只手握住她的手"}
{"time": 1751998531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200105966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1396305618]“说起来结云村的水分是不是太多了”夏弥叹口气“这种环境下，如果古龙直接真的打起来……”"}
{"time": 1751998579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1673060677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“恐怕村子都……”夏弥及时收住了声，至少对无力改变的村民来说，说不定有些事还是不知道比较好"}
{"time": 1751998659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "816427938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1099813836]“……你似乎特别钟意肢体接触”她等了两秒才把手抽出来"}
{"time": 1751998691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1618162041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"把筷子放在碗上，\"或者，我们也该去海边看看...但不管怎样，还是需要去学会那边看看。\""}
{"time": 1751998697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1758356336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你不喜欢吗”小心询问"}
{"time": 1751998739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "945969890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"而且...还不清楚是谁来到了这附近...啧，就好像麻烦在跟着我一样的讨厌感觉。\""}
{"time": 1751998871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588717240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=945969890]“嘛……天塌下来也是我先撑着……我可是风王陛下呢？安不用那么担心啦”夏弥正了正自己的小王冠"}
{"time": 1751998920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "818035913", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1758356336]“说不上，但是不习惯。而且很突然”"}
{"time": 1751998933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2122004035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1758356336]“说不上，但是不习惯。而且很唐突”"}
{"time": 1751998973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "281784550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那之后我会先征求你的意见的，现在好像只能等那鸟回巢了，聊会天吧”"}
{"time": 1751999065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441939129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“沧澜啊，你觉得自己是人还是龙呢”"}
{"time": 1751999170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1659455923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1441939129]“当然是龙”她不假思索"}
{"time": 1751999192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1355355091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你想变回去吗”"}
{"time": 1751999198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635925081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=588717240]\"嗯..my lord。\"手指点点脸颊，若有所思地笑，\"不过当初不是说好当王后吗？\""}
{"time": 1751999296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499695865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1355355091]“嗯……不知道，或许这样也不错。突然感觉，世界大了很多”"}
{"time": 1751999454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1701331975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“其实，听安姐姐说，我好像也不是普通的人类”找一棵树靠着坐下"}
{"time": 1751999479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140427587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=635925081]“趁你还没有变成lord，先让我过过瘾嘛……”夏弥闭上眼趴在桌上“你说，当时我怎么就那么笨，不敢再和你比划比划呢？明明你身上的气息就只有那一瞬……结果就傻傻地被你骗走了”"}
{"time": 1751999593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528604637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1701331975]“安……是前不久见过那个？”沧澜凭空抓住一把和她几乎差不多高的海蓝色双刃大剑，插在地上靠着"}
{"time": 1751999601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1717251097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那你是什么？”"}
{"time": 1751999634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230385391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，是她...她说我也是龙...”"}
{"time": 1751999648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1420731557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她真的说过吗）"}
{"time": 1751999729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1243153563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看不出来”"}
{"time": 1751999753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1917550623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:forward,id=7524781643676568842]"}
{"time": 1751999762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "855665706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（差不多就这个意思吧）"}
{"time": 1751999831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "327009460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=140427587]乖巧地靠着她趴在一起，停顿了一会，才鼓足勇气开口，\"那夏弥...有没有后悔...而且...安再也没有有过那种感觉了...\""}
{"time": 1751999857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1317531624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也一直觉得自己就是个普通人，但偶尔又会展现出一些人不可能做到的能力”"}
{"time": 1751999985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1642990697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=327009460]“或许作为故事的开篇稍显草率，但我没有后悔过哦？”夏弥拨弄着你的头发“对我来说，你是什么不重要……你是谁，才重要”"}
{"time": 1752000087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305473604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1317531624]“那你呢？你自己觉得你是什么？”"}
{"time": 1752000106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "784694638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不知道”手在地上画圈圈"}
{"time": 1752000179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1626462840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（画圈是……）"}
{"time": 1752000198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2030634572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（就是体现了迷茫）"}
{"time": 1752000238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857444708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1642990697]嘴巴微微张着，过了半晌才反应过来开口，\"唔...夏弥真坏，天天说一些撩拨人心弦的话...\"，从椅子上起来，\"走..唔..去学会吧\""}
{"time": 1752000362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "440181562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"绘梨衣回房间好好休息吧？我晚上会给你带外用药的。\"打个招呼牵着夏弥去这边的学会。"}
{"time": 1752000389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1009650417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好复杂啊....”"}
