{"time": 1752037883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1818385820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "问完了最近海边的情报，把这条鱼拖出来"}
{"time": 1752037904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "332682611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说起来我钓到这种奇怪的鱼，请问学会有什么记载吗？\""}
{"time": 1752037997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "142034334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯？”对方拉下眼镜，打量了一番。而你发现这鱼居然还活着，鳃盖轻轻开合，甚至还能蹦跶“这是什么时候钓到的？”"}
{"time": 1752038046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800705575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"昨天吧？\""}
{"time": 1752038132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "957940680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=31459665]（没有回应吗）"}
{"time": 1752038145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1354581689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呐，我能牵着你的手吗”"}
{"time": 1752038224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215351148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“到现在离水多久了？”对方显然也注意到了鱼须“这……还真奇怪。可能是发生了某种变异？除了这须和生命力，其余结构看起来都和大鲔鱼一样”"}
{"time": 1752038272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1714416577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1354581689]“上次我就问过了，你没有回答——你似乎很执着于肢体接触，有原因吗？”"}
{"time": 1752038299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "366238789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样显得比较亲近吧”"}
{"time": 1752038351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1572979344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=215351148]\"嗯...所以感觉很奇怪。\""}
{"time": 1752038405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909622540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=366238789]（哎，翔哥）"}
{"time": 1752038409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145208729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你也好压抑）"}
{"time": 1752038495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1129609326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=366238789]“随便吧”她依旧向前走着，只是左手减小了摆动的幅度，像是默许"}
{"time": 1752038527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1002913621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1572979344]“嗯……可以解剖吗？”他试探性地发问"}
{"time": 1752038539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "692771131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "开心的牵起她的左手"}
{"time": 1752038554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112282474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“回去吃饭喽”"}
