{"time": 1752040723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990884265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦，你不说我都忘了）"}
{"time": 1752041227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "840037454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=543659593]首饰店坐落在某个巷子深处，从装潢到里头的物件都古色古香，油光水滑的实木货架上的物件竟看不见几件款式重复的，比起商店，这里看起来倒更像某种艺术展馆\n而售卖的商品也不止首饰……狼毫制的毛笔，人鱼龙发鳍做的折扇，尾锤龙角制成的角雕……做工无一不精，构思无一不巧。但这些柜台，都只为拱卫一个悬挂在半空的透明展笼"}
{"time": 1752041294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170731448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抬起头看看里面展示着什么"}
{"time": 1752041318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1503197862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那里面是一枚洁白的鳞片，上面似乎雕着些许纹路，在专供盏灯的照射下，同样散发着妖艳的虹光"}
{"time": 1752041324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1636870032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "清清嗓子，表明店里进了人"}
{"time": 1752041364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1597996151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"夏弥，你想要什么位置的首饰?\"手里把玩着鳞片，\"感觉能做的位置有限。\""}
{"time": 1752041369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "419946125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，突然发现）"}
{"time": 1752041379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "526322331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（上次来这不是有个二层工作间）"}
{"time": 1752041388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "359076925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那不就是，月痕山庄）"}
{"time": 1752041400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "937884483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这老板就叫月痕算了（）"}
{"time": 1752041513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2093490329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1636870032]一位须发有些斑白的匠人，从通往不可见二楼的楼梯上走下，倚在栏杆上看着你们“哦……来买什么的？”"}
