{"time": 1752043340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "169438641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=974536609]\"...看样子你还得好好想想这鳞片的切法，不妨我改日再来?\"打个哈欠"}
{"time": 1752043390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "849448836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“得看客人的态度……如果不在乎损耗，倒是有更多办法……”"}
{"time": 1752043534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "162286456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(这玩意质量还挺好，用84洗都不会掉色)"}
{"time": 1752043537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1885373639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，那老板这几日想一想，过几日我再来吧。\""}
{"time": 1752043711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "930083638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好……”他如获至宝般捧过岚龙的鳞片，反复摩挲着"}
{"time": 1752043719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1866406242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么不问问上面挂着的那个）"}
{"time": 1752043731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1862138174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那上面挂着的也是吗？\""}
{"time": 1752043801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "831179069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，那个也是。先前朋友送了我一枚……”"}
{"time": 1752043822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2022062500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?不知是哪位，这么大手笔?\""}
{"time": 1752043856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148270564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“一位相识多年的旧交，现在已经入土了”他说的很平静"}
{"time": 1752043907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1373324766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那时候我还没想好，要怎么处理……只是做了简单的打磨抛光。鬼使神差地……我居然把磨下来的粉尘化入水中饮下”"}
{"time": 1752043934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "933642099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当晚……我便梦见了……祂的模样”"}
{"time": 1752043944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1496260052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...?\""}
{"time": 1752044036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "297481363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还有这种功效吗？\"疑惑地开口"}
{"time": 1752044421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1060598657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我不知道那究竟是不是那鳞粉的功效，我也无从验证我梦境的真伪……但在那惊鸿一面消散之前……我把祂的模样画了下来，以那图景为蓝本，在鳞片上雕了下来……”他拉动一根垂下的绳索，一盏烛台降到鳞雕的背侧。于是光华流转的影子被投在高处的白墙上，像是皮影戏。应该是做了薄厚的处理，龙的形体比那圆形的轮廓明亮得多，或许他的手艺真的能称得上巧夺天工，连鳞片的走向都能看出大概。盘踞的龙首上，龙目的地方格外明亮，你竟然真的有被注视着的感觉"}
{"time": 1752044509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62251029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "仔细打量着雕刻"}
{"time": 1752044518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "500417626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\""}
