{"time": 1752046364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1567293139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"晚上请客，来不来?\"看着她凹造型只能说忍俊不禁，至于赫萝则是，\"带你去吃饭，我请客。\""}
{"time": 1752046424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998338191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1567293139]“又请客？看起来安最近赚的不少嘛”"}
{"time": 1752046475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "760130735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，还算小赚了一笔，而且，钱不就是拿来花的?\"笑眼弯弯，\"不拿来吃饭做什么?\""}
{"time": 1752046546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "896177625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……也对。但是显得我很喜欢占便宜嘛……”"}
{"time": 1752046606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1864241369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，这个无所谓啦，改天请我吃饭不就好了?\"拍拍手，\"待会见咯\""}
{"time": 1752046621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1374457210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还是老地方。\""}
{"time": 1752046648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943251214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行，说起来巴卡尔和狼好像都找到活干了”"}
{"time": 1752046725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1722786313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?那敢情好，巴卡尔大叔是在铁匠铺吧？狼先生?\""}
{"time": 1752046745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "455556720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……好像是去当艺伎了”"}
{"time": 1752046875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1657384436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"?啊\""}
{"time": 1752046882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025505064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...听不懂..\""}
{"time": 1752046924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1202149863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“就是……卖艺不卖身……大概”觉也有点没绷住"}
{"time": 1752047099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459989705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"....好吧\""}
{"time": 1752047101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1103442416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“大概是风俗业吧”"}
{"time": 1752047205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082955146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那我接着去找赫萝了，待会见。\""}
{"time": 1752047233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "545248465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行，我感觉我这身应该也没什么问题？”"}
{"time": 1752047247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "401652137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你是不是把防具素材也给她了）"}
