{"time": 1752048158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "855053595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（总会有这个阶段嘛）"}
{"time": 1752048253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561253027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1438913001]她也没跟你客套，直接拿过去了\n接待员稍显好奇地问到“这位小姐……是其他地方来的猎人吗？是生面孔呢”"}
{"time": 1752048335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744298643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1258598021]里面传来一阵窸窣声。随后她穿着满是破漏的巫女服样式的甲胄给你开了门"}
{"time": 1752048339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1566596600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是你”"}
{"time": 1752048367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "310024331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算是吧”"}
{"time": 1752048388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "929509115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，给你送晚餐。\""}
{"time": 1752048429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "251603679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "递给她打包好的餐盒，\"有好好上药吗？\"打量着她的服装，\"我这里还有一些衣服...\""}
{"time": 1752048490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "995012277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=310024331]“嗯……如果有需要，只要出示猎人证明，这里也可以接取任务的”接待员带着职业化的微笑"}
{"time": 1752048529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1468308697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“沧澜她遭遇了海难，个人物品基本都丢光了”"}
{"time": 1752048544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1856939357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=251603679]“上了”她看起来气消了些，拿过你的餐盒“不用你的衣服，我现在穿不住”"}
{"time": 1752048558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677705317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以办一张新的吗”"}
{"time": 1752048591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "607831576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...那我给你买一些新的。\""}
{"time": 1752048609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "512487544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你想要什么款式?\""}
{"time": 1752048616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011513379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且她的头好像撞到了，以前的事情记得也不是特别清楚”"}
{"time": 1752048668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935316001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=677705317]“啊……全都遗失了吗？这可有些难办……嗯……没有人提供公证的话，只能先从下位猎人开始了”"}
{"time": 1752048687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588315395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没关系的”"}
{"time": 1752048702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "135262746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对吗，沧澜”"}
{"time": 1752048760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1088843422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=512487544]“……不用，穿不住”她拎着餐盒，另一手放在门把手上“没别的事我就关门了”"}
{"time": 1752048779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1325069546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=135262746]“嗯，我无所谓”"}
{"time": 1752048829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1673391293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“话说接待员小姐，猎人等级怎么晋升呢”"}
{"time": 1752048914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584688839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1673391293]“在累计完成了一定数量的委托，积攒了足够名望和贡献之后，就可以自然晋升了……不过也有例外，一般来说，解决了紧急任务，或者讨伐了高危险度的怪物的话，都有破格晋升的可能”"}
{"time": 1752048961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072700501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那现在有没有什么紧急任务”"}
{"time": 1752049001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "987192014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1088843422]\"嗯，拜拜。\""}
{"time": 1752049110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728175560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2072700501]“没有。有的话，会在显眼的地方公示的”"}
{"time": 1752049114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "440407329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "关上门，去吃饭"}
{"time": 1752049168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167356103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“oh，原来是这样”"}
