{"time": 1752056159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1687440719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"太性情了。\""}
{"time": 1752056278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475367223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐之前都请好几次了”"}
{"time": 1752056285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695458074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔，他们关系什么时候这么好了？”觉在你们背后不知道找谁吐槽着"}
{"time": 1752056418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "969559628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是这餐我说了是我请，露儿的话，下次再说吧。\"看向前台，\"结账。\""}
{"time": 1752056440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336349722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“未必吧，我们出来吃饭的时候从来没有抢过”夏弥撑着脑袋"}
{"time": 1752056473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695823001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，好吧，下次我请大家吃饭”"}
{"time": 1752056532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1659762582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说起来绝今天吃的好像也挺少？怎么了，也心情不好？”\n“不……其实是想减重……这身装备有点显身材了……”"}
{"time": 1752056719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792916218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=336349722]结好账回来，\"那不都是我结账吗？\"戳，\"觉身材已经很好了，要多补充一些营养才是。\""}
{"time": 1752056775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1538430378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃个饭）"}
