{"time": 1752068674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946741298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃....为什么”"}
{"time": 1752068711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1439306107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(emo了)"}
{"time": 1752068743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1188570255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉明明是同龄人，安姐姐说的自己一点也听不懂，怀疑安姐姐其实根本不是16岁，只是在装年轻"}
{"time": 1752068864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094276877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（确实是只有觉有办法）"}
{"time": 1752068866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "295548605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...倒也不是完全没意义。\"抬起身子，皱着眉头，\"其实是有些自我怀疑了。\""}
{"time": 1752068936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "888684948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怀疑对错一步跳到虚无主义是不是太快了）"}
{"time": 1752068970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1348468225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“往好处想，安姐姐起码还有个明确的目标”"}
{"time": 1752068993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "753093282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我倒是完全没有什么计划，只能走一步看一步了”"}
{"time": 1752069099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1376145282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啧..这个情绪完全没办法收住啊\""}
{"time": 1752069191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1791716541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哎哎。\"深呼吸，\"露儿说得对，但是有目标很难办也是一种苦闷啦。\""}
{"time": 1752069598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "697590587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"可能最近情绪有些不太好，小露儿，如果影响到你，我道歉。\"站起身，\"就当没听过这些话吧，好吗\""}
{"time": 1752069620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1889694544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐肯定会成功的，毕竟你可是安姐姐啊”"}
{"time": 1752069630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038003339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（打完忘发了）"}
{"time": 1752069668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1498486222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=697590587]“没事的，不用道歉，就算道歉也应该是我道歉”"}
{"time": 1752069682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127027152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不是我的话，你的情绪也不会变糟”"}
{"time": 1752069712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1023245065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1889694544]（好古老的话术）"}
{"time": 1752069740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349857234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（因为我太喜欢热血少年漫了（）"}
{"time": 1752069869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "794991701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"并不是露儿的问题啦。\"呼出口气，\"怎么看都是我自己的问题，唉，不要让我影响你的情绪哦。\""}
{"time": 1752069998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "502310244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐不要在自责了”摸头安慰"}
{"time": 1752070006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1259002719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（作个死）"}
{"time": 1752070043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "591452238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\""}
{"time": 1752070315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1535306644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（与其说鼓励）"}
{"time": 1752070326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335759537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（或许，缺的是坚定的支持）"}
{"time": 1752070347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598518801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "夏弥抱着安的胳膊紧了紧，异常明显地昭示着存在感“安……还记得我们第一次见面的时候吗？”"}
{"time": 1752070488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230272954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抬起头，眸子有些闪烁，\"..记得...不会忘记...怎么了？\""}
{"time": 1752070600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1029195043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那时候，你猜我在想什么？”"}
{"time": 1752070669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1406187031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...?\"看向她"}
{"time": 1752070914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "690033849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当时我完全没有想对错，只是觉得……啊，好生气，于是就朝你们扑过去了”"}
{"time": 1752070965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1940262790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“后来看到那道紫色的雷光我就后悔了，哎，不过那时已经来不及了嘛”"}
{"time": 1752071012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699560132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我那时候都以为自己要死了”"}
{"time": 1752071066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1540924932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "眨眨眼睛，\"...那一下很疼吧..\""}
{"time": 1752071166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "390521617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，失去意识前我在想……啊，我是不是做错了什么”"}
{"time": 1752071288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410248182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“但后来我发现……安对我很好，不会因为我的袭击而对我落井下石，会给我买礼物，会带我认识你的朋友，带我去吃好吃的东西……”"}
{"time": 1752071360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "144849986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还会许诺我，将王冠与我分享”她搓搓你的发尾“嗯……不管怎么看，都会觉得……我们的相遇，绝不是错误”"}
{"time": 1752071441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035801054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"和夏弥相遇是安的幸运，这是安绝不会...放弃的事情。\""}
{"time": 1752071684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1058748692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以，安知道了...\"看向室内的人，\"我不会轻易放弃...就算是为了相遇。"}
{"time": 1752071703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "714973088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不，你注定要成为唯一，这是只有我能确信的东西，是属于我的幸运。所以安……不论如何，和风一样，好吗？风不会停滞，不会折返……遇到山峦便越过，遇到河谷就稍作盘旋……最重要的是，一直是你自己……这就是我的愿望，你欠我的”"}
{"time": 1752071926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "139259771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊...突然在别人面前说这种话什么的...\"鼓起脸颊，\"很犯规啊...我刚刚才想说为了相遇的事...\""}
{"time": 1752071962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1273939925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……这样说见证的人会多一些嘛……”"}
{"time": 1752072114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864231544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在一旁默默的看着"}
{"time": 1752072116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1165700161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧，既然夏弥都这么说了，我确实亏欠了很多呢...\"站起身拍拍手，\"那就精神满满再次出发吧！毕竟夏弥都说..风不会停歇。\"转过头，手指放在唇前对着露儿比一个嘘声的手势，\"小露儿，这些话要忘记哦?\""}
{"time": 1752072178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "726431311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我..我什么都没听见”刚刚的场景对于16岁的小女孩来说还是有点太...有点脸红"}
{"time": 1752072259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2057949244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我明明也才16岁诶，露儿为什么看上去就比我小这么多?\""}
{"time": 1752072300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570670616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摇摇头"}
{"time": 1752072314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1110592605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "转过身，捏捏夏弥的脸颊，\"是不是和夏弥在一起久了，弄得安都老了\""}
{"time": 1752072316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1411409860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐绝对谎报年龄了对吧”坚信"}
{"time": 1752072467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513773529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真的才十六岁哦?露儿被保护得很好呢。\""}
{"time": 1752072813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357913806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦，既然决心要打起精神出发。\"下楼去看看集会所的任务"}
{"time": 1752073009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154852456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（突然就任务了）"}
{"time": 1752073028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "296760565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（露儿呢）"}
