{"time": 1752078907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "949306364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，点头。那就麻烦觉了。我会带着炎火的丸子回来的。\"笑，\"过几天再见啦。\""}
{"time": 1752078913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058197863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还有负责过kp想让你们过的侦查骰子）"}
