{"time": 1752079138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1421648976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"在吗？绘梨衣大人。\"语气轻松了一些"}
{"time": 1752079163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2017454131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1421648976]“……干嘛”依旧是闷闷的声音"}
{"time": 1752079245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1658044682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=741285140]“你要带沧澜出去？为啥？”她坐正“我还没开始观察呢，你就把我的病人带走了？”"}
{"time": 1752079281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1092447671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“多活动活动比较好吧，之后你再慢慢观察”"}
