{"time": 1752124406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1377453640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"您好，我来取一下鳞片磨出的粉末\""}
{"time": 1752124504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "987391387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1377453640]“哦……是你”店主从栏杆后探出头来，折了回去，随后拿着一个小纸包下了楼"}
{"time": 1752124636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "577235039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"谢谢，成品什么时候可以取?\"接过纸包"}
{"time": 1752124699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898291617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不知道”他摇头“不过这个鳞雕花了我五天，应该不会比这个长”"}
{"time": 1752124812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114173580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我倒也不急，那就过几日再说吧。\""}
