{"time": 1752125459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631882691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“岚龙？安姐姐从哪搞来的这么贵重的东西”"}
{"time": 1752125531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "568280281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"运气比较好啦，从鱼肚子里掏出来的。\""}
{"time": 1752125569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452355412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“看样子安姐姐是天选之人啊”"}
{"time": 1752125581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "252664923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"可惜那只鱼送了研究员，不然我还想请露儿尝尝味道。\""}
{"time": 1752125666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "276814484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说天选什么的...让人有些害羞了。\"偏偏脑袋，\"露儿带路吧。\""}
{"time": 1752125698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1455779748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你是天选，也是唯一）"}
