{"time": 1752125874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1216256597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“蝴蝶小姐，改变计划了，我们不准备出远门了，准备就近找个任务做”"}
{"time": 1752125920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1113674373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"是先休息几天啦，等他们伤好。\"在后面补充"}
{"time": 1752125983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727652193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打量一下这个医生，\"医生?\""}
{"time": 1752126055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1147319125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯？不出门了吗？”蝴蝶抬头“还好我还没开始收拾东西”"}
