{"time": 1752126190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "113313437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=727652193]比起结云村中常见的和服，医者的衣着更贴身，更干练。脸上总归避不了黑眼圈和皱纹，不过声音比面色听上去年轻一些"}
{"time": 1752126324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1437351097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1201450822]“哦，那挺好。”蝴蝶抽出针管“你就是露儿说的，队伍里的上位猎人？”"}
{"time": 1752126372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1187092572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点点头，\"嗯..\""}
