{"time": 1752141635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1130027534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=988123067][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “嗯嗯，医生你放心吧”"}
