{"time": 1752142953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1034694006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=288851162]\"没事...\"握住她的手，\"怎么说也是安来背嘛，夏弥不要有负罪感啦。\"拿一个包子堵住夏弥的嘴巴，\"啊～\""}
{"time": 1752142960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1482130703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“成年之后就分开了”"}
{"time": 1752142979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1238521592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你想他们吗”"}
{"time": 1752143344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2035959068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1034694006]“毕竟之前比现在可爱多了嘛……唔，啊~”夏弥咬下一口，揉进了笋丁的肉馅不论是味道还是口感都相当不错"}
{"time": 1752143387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "726014315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1238521592]“没有，为什么要想？成年了就该分开”"}
{"time": 1752143582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2106511169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=726014315]“但说实话，我连样子都记不清……反正原本也长得差不多吧。但变成这样之前的事，全都只有模糊的记忆，感觉、意识，几乎都没有”"}
{"time": 1752143585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123153399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，来日方长。\"帮夏弥擦擦嘴，小口喝白粥"}
