{"time": 1752143943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "27616796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2106511169] “这样吗...希望你之后能收获珍贵的回忆”"}
{"time": 1752144116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "149310784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "绘梨衣点的挺多，但吃的也不少，也许她真的有在计算食物的量。最后吃下一颗章鱼丸子，她捂着嘴轻轻打了个嗝，开始揉自己的肚子。桌上剩的菜，规整规整大概还够一人份的"}
{"time": 1752144174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631504536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=27616796]“嗯。这是祝福？”"}
{"time": 1752144183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1736515787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是的呢”"}
{"time": 1752144387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137028180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谢谢”她点点头“你人还挺好的”"}
{"time": 1752144394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1126759824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好人卡说是）"}
{"time": 1752144420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569956846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢夸奖”"}
{"time": 1752144421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392358155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，我是不是）"}
{"time": 1752144435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "293202033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（外貌描写给少了，所以没有攻略的感觉）"}
{"time": 1752144509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2124995774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=149310784]\"哇哦...也许是错怪你了，绘梨衣大人。\"不过自己显然也不需要再吃了，放下筷子，\"绘梨衣之后要去温泉吗？\""}
{"time": 1752144602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "983510372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“陆地的风景你之前应该没这么见过吧”"}
{"time": 1752144810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1833909480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么）"}
{"time": 1752144949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1480100287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2124995774]“干嘛”她朝你望过来，像是不满于意图被你发现。你绝对没有给过她化妆品，但她的眼角总是带着些许桃红色的眼影"}
{"time": 1752145285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1109314371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=983510372]“差不多吧。虽然我们也不是一辈子都在水里。不过上了岸就和螃蟹一样，只能伏在地面上”她左顾右盼，明明每处曲线都修长优雅，但看上去就是饱含力量感"}
{"time": 1752145345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "196384467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“海底也很漂亮吧，可惜太深的地方我不太看的清”"}
{"time": 1752145481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "22949124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(突然加上外貌?)"}
{"time": 1752145503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1445073407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=196384467]“大部分地方都光秃秃的。太深的地方……”沧澜皱眉“都很危险”"}
{"time": 1752145509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "742189429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=22949124]（该加的）"}
{"time": 1752145514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1891049258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（毕竟这是）"}
{"time": 1752145517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1987624603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（gal团）"}
{"time": 1752145526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338238038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对于沧澜来说也很危险吗”"}
{"time": 1752145599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "520116509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“水压越来越大，能在那里活下来的家伙，要么不好吃，要么很厉害”"}
{"time": 1752145835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "430843192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“原来是这样”"}
{"time": 1752145850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "80244071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1480100287]\"温泉应该不用我付钱了吧？\"笑，梳理一下额头的碎发，总是不怎么满意，\"安准备这几天逛逛街，需要我带饭吗？\""}
{"time": 1752146296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1193534008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=80244071]“随你”她站起身来，皱了皱眉，随后左右扭了扭腰“算了，我要出去走走”"}
{"time": 1752146614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2067159202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=430843192]“不过陆地上不一样，总是阳光明媚。声音总是很轻快，还能有火……才有熟食”"}
{"time": 1752146693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561919443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你喜欢就好...”"}
{"time": 1752146765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "983936261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1193534008]\"感觉不太放心。\"小声喃喃，随后开口，\"可以和安一起吗？\""}
