{"time": 1752151331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2086853629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1752151349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1354850282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，这都多亏了沧澜，我会更小心的”"}
{"time": 1752151397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "320622370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1835738889]\"呼...\"在溪流边停住，\"绘梨衣大人，还走吗？我们准备烤鱼吃了。\""}
{"time": 1752151539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "654250762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1354850282]沧澜单手拎着那人宽的大剑，长发在大树倒下的余波中翻飞，每一道弧线都像海浪。那俩肌肉大只佬似乎并没有在意你们，依然自顾自地翻滚着\n“总之，没事就好”"}
{"time": 1752151570, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961441700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好帅...”"}
{"time": 1752151603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1556828724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(卡酷一)"}
