{"time": 1752151695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1282027583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "继续去取蜂蜜"}
{"time": 1752151812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2079906514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=320622370]“这不是还没消完食”她没有停下来的意思，捏着上衣的下摆鼓着风你听见她自己一个人嘀咕“而且中午越来越热了……要不索性这层也收起来？”"}
{"time": 1752151826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1366533119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1282027583]（丢球？）"}
