{"time": 1752153210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743394748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1008725811]“哦？你怕这个？”她呲了呲牙"}
{"time": 1752153278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2119540472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“怕什么？”有些疑惑"}
{"time": 1752153358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "683061915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1695444730]“闻得出来”不可能闻不出来，新采的天然蜂蜜，和胶水一样稠。入口几乎要用嚼的。她用手指蘸了一点，却带起拉不完的丝，好不容易才能入口"}
{"time": 1752153371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760453719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2119540472]（我要是说趴脱衣服是不是有点压抑了）"}
{"time": 1752153465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78763186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（那也太压抑了）"}
{"time": 1752153489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "440500121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那不就是怕猎区（）"}
{"time": 1752153530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785435662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么样？”期待的等着回应"}
{"time": 1752153758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706544474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=683061915]“哦……”她有些惊喜地抬头。毕竟，对自然生物而言，蜂蜜几乎是唯一获取“甜味”的来源。而蜂蜜的甜的却是那样突出，就好像……全世界所有造物中，唯有它得天独厚\n“哦……这可真是了不起”沧澜不住地点头“难怪那俩家伙会为这个打起来……这种味道，有点……幸福”"}
{"time": 1752153895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2090608715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“中午让saki整几条蜂蜜烤鱼，味道也很不错的”"}
{"time": 1752153913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314319992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（如果我想做个花环要过什么呢龙）"}
