{"time": 1752214036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1237499893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=833099523]看起来没有人叫就醒了，和你一样凝望着大海"}
