{"time": 1752214574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "29666781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像差不多该回去了，不过我们可以在村子里再逛逛，或者你有什么想去的地方吗”"}
{"time": 1752214657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "171502670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1097879119]\"siro的手艺很好吧?\"说完，拿着鱼递给夏弥，自己也吃一口"}
