{"time": 1752244355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "290308119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=46354656]\"诶...?\"拿出帕子帮她擦擦眼泪，扶住肩膀，不知道能说什么，眨眨眼..沉默着等她说话"}
