{"time": 1752245640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1531303166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=290308119]她像是有些丢了魂，眼神里似乎少了些什么……一些你并不熟悉的东西"}
{"time": 1752245797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1923380770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1531303166]扶住她轻轻摇摇，轻声开口，\"回家吗？\""}
