{"time": 1752310364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767074558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=377044468]（醒着吗）"}
{"time": 1752310412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1318562670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（嗯）"}
{"time": 1752310686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "43961896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "颜色清雅的宽松白裙，缀着金色的珊瑚纹样和鲸尾般的腰带。关键的纽扣圆润饱满，似乎是牛角……大概没有这么大的珍珠，吧？"}
{"time": 1752310729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1691659704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”沧澜顺着你指的看过去，从衣架上取下这件"}
{"time": 1752310735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005389410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这个？”"}
{"time": 1752310850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "46724106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯，沧澜快换上看看吧，一定很好看”"}
{"time": 1752310892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2107652707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "似乎有点短——沧澜的身高在女猎人中都算拔群。而和服的消费群众大多是寻常村民"}
{"time": 1752310964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152617483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我在想）"}
{"time": 1752310970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "39959534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你在想）"}
{"time": 1752310971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1983858536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她可能不知道有试衣间这种东西）"}
{"time": 1752311134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1022378046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以你能不能主动告诉她在哪，不然她要当场换了）"}
{"time": 1752311147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "63888924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“去那边那个试衣间”牵着她的手带着她去"}
{"time": 1752311161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1874391433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（神秘牵手女）"}
{"time": 1752311258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565718978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我教你，主动把行为的原因解释了，就不用我问为什么，显得两边都像人机）"}
{"time": 1752311303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025629512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1752311387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767315693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要给陌生人看你的身体，只有非常非常非常亲密的人才可以给她看”"}
{"time": 1752311450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "738931927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是非常非常非常亲密也不可以吗（）"}
{"time": 1752311545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "23744343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她被你推进试衣间，里面传出窸窸窣窣的布料摩擦声，还有一个问句——“多亲密才算非常非常非常亲密？”"}
{"time": 1752311711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "287341891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？”认真思考“可能大概是可以互相托付人生的那种程度吧”"}
{"time": 1752311761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305154706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就像安姐姐和夏弥那样吧，可能”"}
{"time": 1752311843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34718922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“听起来，嗯……有点不靠谱。如果有人骗人怎么办？”"}
{"time": 1752311906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "431139367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以一定要非常非常非常谨慎啊”"}
{"time": 1752312045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1279187835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且在沧澜有这个能力之前，我会帮你把关的”拍拍胸脯"}
{"time": 1752312063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1275149411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“但是……就算谨慎，也还是可能被骗”她依旧不解"}
{"time": 1752312272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1577968211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，那最稳妥的就是不给任何人看了”"}
{"time": 1752312365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588097980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我只是觉得有点……麻烦。你们的规则里似乎有很多……界定模糊的部分”"}
{"time": 1752312388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1215147839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没关系，我会慢慢教你的”"}
{"time": 1752312438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1845510266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“毕竟情感本来就是比较复杂的东西，相关的东西复杂也正常”"}
{"time": 1752312640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1434214647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好吧，谢谢你”里面的动静停了，她撩开帘子走出来。的确有些小了——原本应该能过膝的裙沿停在她膝盖上面。而原本应该系在腰上的束带则托在她胸口下沿……看起来更宏伟了"}
{"time": 1752312809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "992779932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "里头有镜子，她应该已经照过了"}
{"time": 1752312822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "152549156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我觉得还行”"}
{"time": 1752312888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2089090424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“沧澜真漂亮啊，穿什么都好看”"}
{"time": 1752312955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1029997050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来你平时穿什么）"}
{"time": 1752313111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991197567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（小裙子吧）"}
{"time": 1752313180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1918260029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1752313185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "623113402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（详细一点）"}
{"time": 1752313232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1587003549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（让我想想）"}
{"time": 1752313408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448219805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2089090424]“嗯，比我预料中好些……很难想象，我是怎么从那个样子变成这样的”她转过身去，又打量着镜子里的自己——似乎是她醒来之后第一次认真照镜子“还挺好看”"}
{"time": 1752313487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1940507374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "美中不足的是，由于这衣服有些短了，因此遮不住她身侧伤口的末端。看起来就像瓷娃娃身上被磨去一块"}
{"time": 1752313685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "902293395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，之前没有镜子”看看花环在哪"}
{"time": 1752313709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "224686101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（应该戴着 吧）"}
{"time": 1752313737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "488303185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你觉得花环怎么样”期待的看着她等待她的评价"}
{"time": 1752313954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "5088283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还不错，天然的东西简单组合居然也能变成这个样子”她点点头，不过看得出来她不擅长夸赞"}
{"time": 1752314146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "616056503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢你喜欢”开心的抱一下她"}
{"time": 1752314294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "264497336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“为什么谢我？做得好是你的本领”她确实比你高不少，你的额头只能到她的肩膀"}
{"time": 1752314467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "261791915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“因为你喜欢是对我的认可啊，我很开心”"}
{"time": 1752314650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "754408810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了沧澜，尺码是不是有点小，要不要换件大一些的”"}
{"time": 1752314729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "599424043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔……”她若有所思“嗯……确实有一点，紧……”"}
{"time": 1752314945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260056727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以去这款大一点的吗”找店员问问"}
{"time": 1752315139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "697395706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦呀？”身着华服的龙人少女探了探头，声音倒是与外观匹配的年轻“嗯……不巧。这一款没有做码数更大的成衣。是给这位女士买吗？”"}
{"time": 1752315535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1434692340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“唉？这么不巧吗，确实是给她买的，这该怎么办呢”"}
