{"time": 1752323778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2022337736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(的说)"}
{"time": 1752323874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "276876462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔，照着那个做是吧”店长转了转笔，起身去裁了两匹布下来“材料带工费，1200z。明天就能拿”"}
{"time": 1752323900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1496384264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，谢谢店长，那我们先走了😊”"}
{"time": 1752324300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610548341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=587247387]“嗯……素一些，也不错。啊……对了”夏弥从袖口里摸出那颗绿光流转的珠子“能拜托先生，用这个做个发绳或者发簪吗？”"}
{"time": 1752324315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404724936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "和沧澜离开"}
