{"time": 1752324360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460609089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，那个花环确实不错，不过可惜保存不了太久，要不我们去看看有没有其他什么好看的装饰品吧”(✧◡✧)"}
{"time": 1752324476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642511305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1460609089]“行，反正今天也没别的事……你的钱，还够吗？”"}
{"time": 1752324509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160308859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还剩不少吧，昨天不是刚赚了小1w”"}
{"time": 1752324522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648371250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“钱不够再去接委托就是了”"}
