{"time": 1752324595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1816845357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我都忘了你们拖着那个招摇过市了）"}
