{"time": 1752335865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1955753908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我还是第一次看见女孩子和女孩子结婚，你们婚礼的时候一定要通知我”👀🌟"}
{"time": 1752336051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1970838415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...估计不会在结云吧。\"沉思，\"要是去了天南海北，安到时候从哪里找到露儿呢？\""}
{"time": 1752336100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1597481084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“唉？你们到时候提前写信寄村子里吧，我会过去的，不管多远”"}
{"time": 1752336127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1817299519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（等你到了黄花菜都凉了）"}
{"time": 1752336213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1044039424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶....露儿的意思是，以后都留在结云咯?\"笑着打趣，\"我可是要回最北边的村子啦。露儿走过去要一年半载吧？\""}
{"time": 1752336271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226755047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（风起地（）"}
{"time": 1752336303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1495992125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不知道哎，不过我目前的目标是先把附近的古龙讨伐了”"}
{"time": 1752336351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1640995207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你的话也挺变态的）"}
