{"time": 1752336460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1136550152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你是抱着什么样的决心说出这种话的)"}
{"time": 1752336481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1373196085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘛，古龙可不是努努力就能打败的东西”夏弥嘴角的笑意似有若无"}
{"time": 1752336533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2035840293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不试试怎么知道呢，我的目标可是成为世界第一猎人，古龙肯定是这条道路上重要的难关”"}
{"time": 1752336545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098672852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"确实呢？\"笑容明显很多，\"我这里可有一个符合你预期的目标，露儿要不要试试?\""}
{"time": 1752336556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "273857732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1752336641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1524119834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"灵峰之主啦，结云的大岚神啦，天津祸土啦，怎么样，这个目标?\"噙着笑开口"}
{"time": 1752336821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857328454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不管是灵峰那只，还是海里那只，我都会向它们发起挑战的”"}
{"time": 1752336885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715031716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(生活的大风车?)"}
