{"time": 1752336909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1174926836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=88F37A1CC9D5254905F1F2EB55F422C9.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSiGXrxRVWd9JfktGYSTqFRAFCpWhjw-gsg_woos57B19u3jgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQQizwRR4HGKq0dKAJoS-0X3oC0rE&amp;rkey=CAESMCQpHJbBE9Cq56heU_JSV6oy17O5Oh-PdzbSpNQ8BcU3tZh-jUa0PxOj35csvsNh_g,file_size=195952]"}
{"time": 1752336942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21951396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“虽然打压年轻人的信心不太好……但是偶尔是不是也该敲打敲打？毕竟她可能真的做得出来……”"}
{"time": 1752337089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "976728643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“敲打？”沧澜提取到了关键词，隐隐站在你们之间"}
{"time": 1752337122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "72044167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么了，沧澜？”"}
{"time": 1752337155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "278867063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……不是真的要打她啦”夏弥笑着摆摆手"}
{"time": 1752337229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1817140450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，年轻人就是要气盛啦，不气盛还是年轻人嘛？嘿嘿，这点我也一样。\"靠着夏弥，看着露儿开口，\"不过夏弥说的也有道理，你见过古龙吗？\""}
{"time": 1752337388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294386074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哈...哈”尴尬摇摇头"}
{"time": 1752337457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593200628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没有见过吗？\"收起笑容，\"你是怀着什么觉悟说出这种话的。\""}
{"time": 1752337488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "823725426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我...去看看？”"}
