{"time": 1752338302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1777151482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐太成熟了...”"}
{"time": 1752338371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1490207823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...那之后要不要，和我一起去爬那座山?先把这个作为第一事项呢？\""}
{"time": 1752338398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1918871622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的吗，可以带上我吗”激动"}
{"time": 1752338490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725321662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毕竟你想要向古龙发起挑战，不是很合适么？\""}
{"time": 1752338519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685974647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我愿意，我会去的”"}
{"time": 1752338670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807661186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那露儿现在就要好好磨砺磨砺才是，以那个家伙为目标的话，会很难哦?\""}
{"time": 1752338702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "314194932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯，我会更努力的”"}
{"time": 1752338824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1285338529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"也不用太辛苦啦，还要待很长很长一段时间。\"伸出手摸摸露儿脑袋，\"不过现在露儿身边也有值得信赖的同伴，我也不用太担心了呢。\""}
{"time": 1752338952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1037874962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢安姐姐”低下头"}
{"time": 1752339091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1555990828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我的打算是....结束之后回家举办婚礼，露儿要是想参加的话，到时候可以跟我一起?\"先不谈麻烦的地方，谈一些轻松的事情吧"}
{"time": 1752339115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1576474782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（打完这架就去结婚？）"}
