{"time": 1752339164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421118608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐不要立flag啊，话本上说这样不太好”"}
{"time": 1752339276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1624610446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"....\"敲敲她脑袋，\"这种话就算想说也不要当着我的面好吗\""}
{"time": 1752339302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1289716293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那是什么？”夏弥歪头"}
{"time": 1752339319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1057218030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎呦”抱着自己的头“对了，安姐姐，店主在哪，我想买东西来着”"}
{"time": 1752339522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "592739278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这丫头在说我们的旅行会不顺利啦。\"收回手，\"突然就不开心了呢。\""}
{"time": 1752339545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767885758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不是这个意思啦”连忙摆手"}
