{"time": 1752383998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2100769204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（在经受衣品的考验）"}
{"time": 1752384200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905066943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=290335301]集会所的厨师多半都是科班出身，菜式经典正宗，用料讲究。光论手艺还在龙の食堂之上。只是不会出现大型怪物的食材。凉菜先走，随后主食与正菜一并铺满了大半张桌子"}
{"time": 1752384482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1568694751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我要开动了”开吃"}
{"time": 1752385060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1725111058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“唔诶……嗯……”夏弥的目光在衣架上来回探索，最后取下一组套裙。里件轻柔细软，躯干部位是轻柔贴身的白纱，领颈处倒是宽大起来，不包着肩膀，袖子仅过肘两寸，倒像是短袍。外件则是绸缎质地的红色露背长裙，布料边缘从腰后开始，绕过肋骨和腋下，裹住胸前，收成一个碎花颈环。腰带不宽，在腰侧收着一个蝴蝶结"}
{"time": 1752385076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "274591433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（参考文献）"}
{"time": 1752385076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1323568517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=BDC2CD96424DCC591BE4A4F3B8EB56C1.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRZtuphwFXGRjXaB4nok_85o_eivxjp_gwg_woo5Keyj4-5jgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQSpGHEAboGo3kGqfnvTTr-noClgc&amp;rkey=CAQSMNBTWQDyHbgEnZ6RTB6fCd7Vntk1AWkVIZkNqodz5oBZvbnh922fT4bGmKOUtbC4Ow,file_size=212841]"}
