{"time": 1752385329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133001059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"红色...诶，是不是太张扬了一些?\"看着这套裙子，有些想象不到穿在身上的样子"}
{"time": 1752385372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1916149716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1568694751]沧澜一开始吃的很快，三四口就能把一碗拉面连带配菜一同吃下。不过一人份过后，她也慢下来，开始细品……或者说享受菜肴的滋味"}
{"time": 1752385660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "507843836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=133001059]“现在是春天啦，可以鲜艳一些吧？”"}
{"time": 1752385827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "580926464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"虽然是这么说...感觉好大胆...\"接过裙子，下意识卷了卷自己垂下的发梢，\"那...去试一试?\""}
{"time": 1752385869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1942100202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（红色在日系里倒是很常见的颜色）"}
