{"time": 1752400608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659103677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“去把衣服脱了吧，记得把浴巾裹上”嘱咐沧澜"}
{"time": 1752400622, "type": "recv", "message_id": "492089376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（卸甲？）"}
{"time": 1752400747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "15261043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1813757056]\"嗯...如果裙子这里改大一点，应该会好一些?\"扭头看向老板，\"老板娘能裁一下吗？\""}
{"time": 1752400992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1464398917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=659103677]“嗯……就没有能穿下水的衣服吗？”沧澜关好门，把衣服随手脱了放到一旁，迈入温热的池水中，再拿过浴巾往自己身上一盖……只能说不是很传统"}
{"time": 1752401039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876999277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去更衣室把衣服脱了裹上浴袍然后进池子里"}
{"time": 1752401063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648905049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，泳装的话算是可以下水的衣服”"}
{"time": 1752401095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659000903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=15261043]“只改大裙摆，就是百褶裙了”店长抬头瞄了一眼"}
{"time": 1752401306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "69944025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=659000903]\"嗯...也还算能接受啦，就是下半身要穿一些别的东西...或者穿个纱制的半袖?\""}
{"time": 1752401337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1732923077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（已经有半袖了）"}
{"time": 1752401379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1954599098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "慢慢的进水，只留头在外面“好舒服啊”身体逐渐放松，感觉一天的劳累逐渐散去"}
{"time": 1752401420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "993125989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1648905049]“这样……我还没见过”沧澜往池子里一点点滑下去“唔……有点麻麻痒痒的”"}
{"time": 1752401702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "354919140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛...裙子倒是设计的很好啦。\"走到前台，\"老板娘觉得怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1752401724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "626090283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（美女底子不错（）"}
