{"time": 1752423575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "710658450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=507963589]“不能这么说啦，人又不是只要会战斗就好了”她空出手来摩挲你指头上的戒指“大家明明都很感谢你”"}
{"time": 1752423656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "556819408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=347658568]总之你换好了衣服，但是沧澜的身前有一大道模糊的印子"}
{"time": 1752423685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "835020211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起，我刚刚太激动了....把你衣服弄湿了”"}
