{"time": 1752424803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "591760346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1575092835]总之走了"}
{"time": 1752424897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "753569881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "路上多少有人朝你们这边撇两眼……但毕竟是浴场，身上沾点水也不是什么怪事"}
{"time": 1752425095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1231355325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=166958764]“安在右手圈上我胳膊的时候就想好了这一步吗？唔唔……狡猾狡猾”夏弥夹起一只煎饺，吹凉一些再放到你嘴边"}
{"time": 1752425236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "436235638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1231355325]\"当然啦，我现在没有手了哦。\"咬一口煎饺，嚼两口咽下去，\"这里的手艺还是一惯地好啦，唔...安要不要也学着做饭呢?\""}
