{"time": 1752425570, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1720902683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（伊神我们回来了）"}
{"time": 1752425575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166993346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们回到了已经打烊但还亮着灯的诊所"}
{"time": 1752425582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1087825516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1720902683]（你是？）"}
{"time": 1752425628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438081146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你是?)"}
{"time": 1752425769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "128840799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1519227819]“哦，回来了……我这里有些不算成果的成果，想不想听听？”"}
{"time": 1752425784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509308325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“说来听听”"}
{"time": 1752425829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691674816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=436235638]“嗯……等有了长住的地方，有了厨房……机会应该不少吧”"}
{"time": 1752425927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1443587493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉...夏弥这么一说...安突然想起在雪山的大房子...突然又想勉强自己了，早点回家。\"蹭蹭"}
{"time": 1752426052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "989802973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=509308325]“沧澜的血液，我简单研究了一下。非常不讲道理……理化性质上，与海龙的血样性质一致。说白了，尽管外形和构成上，沧澜已经是人类，但她的身体仍然认为她是海龙”"}
{"time": 1752426063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1916669565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“其次，更不讲道理的是”"}
{"time": 1752426080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1860971065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是？”"}
{"time": 1752426392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1168436680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“理化性质一样的前提下，成分并不一致”蝴蝶挑眉“质量一致，比例一致，但就是多些东西。不与任何试剂反应，状态与环境完全无关……的某些东西。似乎是白色的。只会在不关注它的时候出现，一旦注意到它就会消失。就好像不属于可知的世界”"}
{"time": 1752426417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "684691588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？好神奇”"}
{"time": 1752426452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1064774389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“第一反应居然不是好诡异吗”"}
{"time": 1752426458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1793823230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了医生，你应该不会把沧澜的事情说出去吧”"}
{"time": 1752426499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "486022569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1443587493]“嗯……反正来去也要不了几天……这边的景色也不错嘛，要不在这边也……？”"}
{"time": 1752426562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "806999549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...好像也不错，明天去街上挑一挑?\""}
{"time": 1752426745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1146668828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1793823230]“平心而论，我倒是很想这么干。这些发现太过……震撼，也太玄乎，说不定隐含着生命的深层奥秘。于名，于利，于时代，会感兴趣的人比天上的星星都多”"}
{"time": 1752426779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1467295037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不行不行，沧澜会有危险的”"}
{"time": 1752426880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1174356020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=806999549]“嗯，起码……先看看嘛，至于钱的事……”"}
{"time": 1752426901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659552052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“再说啦再说”夏弥又伸个懒腰"}
{"time": 1752426987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1785459411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"松开手开始吃饭，吃完之后打包一份，\"好啦，今天该休息了\""}
{"time": 1752427005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "952969315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说实话，有种大闹了一通的感觉。\"揉揉眼睛"}
{"time": 1752427043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634751357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1467295037]“是啊，如果我只是一个研究员，我肯定就这么干了”蝴蝶转着笔，随后“啪”的一下翻在桌上“最多把血液来源匿名一下。不过我是个医生……那就做不到了”"}
{"time": 1752427118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604097944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=952969315]“总感觉安对大闹一通好轻车熟路……在我认识你之前，是不是就很有这方面的经验了？”"}
{"time": 1752427331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "701986270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=604097944]\"...没有哦，16岁进山之前，安都是乖乖女啦，毕竟没有亲人...又不想做猎人...\"一边说一边上楼"}
{"time": 1752427397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "323750157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢你医生，你人真好”"}
{"time": 1752427426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877766726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（想给医生说秘密了，思考一下）"}
{"time": 1752427583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1380402087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=701986270]“喔……原来是压抑了”夏弥小声，跟着你上楼"}
{"time": 1752427728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1047055089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（xyy）"}
{"time": 1752427757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "47793292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1380402087]\"似乎是后来才变成这样性格的，不过活泼一些也好吧...之前安可是死气沉沉的。\"走到绘梨衣门前敲敲门"}
{"time": 1752427812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1657222807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=323750157]“医生的底线罢了”她耸耸肩“不过我都知情了，不会这么简单放弃求知的”"}
{"time": 1752427839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1406728257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那医生，你这么好我告诉你一个秘密吧”"}
{"time": 1752428085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1622088190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=47793292]“总不能是我害的吧，夏弥不背这个锅喔”夏弥站在你后面，不过门里过了很久才有反应，绘梨衣给你开了门，不过看起来和你们下午分开的时候比起来没有好多少……甚至床上的被子都没掀，看上去她就在被子上趴了一下午"}
{"time": 1752428119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1504589572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1406728257]“什么玩意”她有些莫名其妙"}
{"time": 1752428152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21213526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我之前碰到一个高人，说我的血蛮特殊的，医生你要不要看看”"}
{"time": 1752428163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "192828135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且我感觉最近身体好像也出了问题”"}
{"time": 1752428257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025455939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……你这算有病，不算有秘密”蝴蝶嘴角抽了抽“又给我出难题？”"}
{"time": 1752428278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "450206510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你抽出来观察观察么”"}
{"time": 1752428361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "939951587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1622088190]\"晚上好。\"带着打包好的饭菜和几套衣服走进屋，把饭菜放在桌上，\"这是晚上的菜，绘梨衣要记得吃。\"衣服整理好放进衣柜，\"买了几套宽松的居家服，我放进柜子啦，唔...这些穿起来应该也不会影响伤口。\"停了一下，\"提起伤口，药有好好上吗？\""}
{"time": 1752428493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2071342991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=450206510]“……随你”她拿出一根新的针管"}
