{"time": 1752457871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68995528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉下一句话该是“你说人这辈子活着是为了什么”或者“没意思，跳了”）"}
