{"time": 1752460192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "560688096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1752460331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "726812016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她一时语塞，过了好一会才开口“那你们呢？”"}
{"time": 1752460411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570103151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不过...从现在的角度看，绘梨衣无论如何，也是人类吧？”继续开口，“是什么取决于自我认知。”听到她的问题偏过头问夏弥，“夏弥觉得呢？要说吗？”"}
{"time": 1752460469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "986875374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我的话...虽然有点不太清楚，但或许就是你口中山上那位哦？”"}
{"time": 1752460842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1243083231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我在想）"}
