{"time": 1752461292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617574371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（阿瞒盖饭啊）"}
{"time": 1752461932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429032645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……也不算秘密了吧？知道的人也不少”夏弥拟造出翅翼般的金属披风，无因而起的气流汇聚，她在屋内简单地腾空“风暴的主人……唔唔，至少在那位不在的时候还是可以这么自居的”"}
{"time": 1752462060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312484040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶，我这不是在吗？\"调笑着插上一句"}
{"time": 1752462152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521118805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“之前有天，我在水底呆了好久好久，然后出水的时候才感觉到肺里面全是水，没有什么空气”"}
{"time": 1752462449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1636819479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“然后皮肤泡水里不管时间多久好像都没事”"}
{"time": 1752462524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1776283110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=312484040]“安又不会因为这个打我……”夏弥吐了吐舌头。绘梨衣又沉默了好一阵，才闭眼长叹道“……原来是这样……那就不奇怪了”"}
{"time": 1752462790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "395140660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1636819479]“怎么可能”蝴蝶皱了皱眉，伸出两根指头撑开你脖子上的皮肤“你又没长腮，是鱼吗你？”"}
{"time": 1752462847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1137726026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的，我没骗人”真诚的看着医生"}
{"time": 1752462850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1427730145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1776283110]\"诶...\"蹲下身，\"绘梨衣觉得不意外吗？\""}
{"time": 1752463292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1137693484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1137726026]“我记得海龙的肺都不能进水吧”蝴蝶把你的血样放到显微镜下，抽空扭头看了一眼沧澜，后者点头表示肯定“而且你不是正儿八经在村子里长大的吗？”"}
{"time": 1752463313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478677314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（骑个车）"}
