{"time": 1752464458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "426910031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1594174382]\"所以我才会去找那位啦，也是为了验明我到底是谁。\"看着她突然翻了个身，\"诶，怎么躺下了，背上的伤刚上的药诶\""}
{"time": 1752464839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "511369064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也不知道为什么会这样....”"}
{"time": 1752464882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2112630075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=426910031]“只是……很久没有这样呼吸了……这可真是……哈哈，咳咳……和我比起来，你们像怪物多了”"}
{"time": 1752465011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1487474028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=511369064]“往好处想的话，可能只是某种突变”蝴蝶离开显微镜前，去去了些不知名试剂，往血样中滴加"}
{"time": 1752465176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160276091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2112630075]\"随你怎么说啦。\"把她扶起来，轻轻拍拍背顺气，\"安就是安，夏弥就是夏弥，始终如一。\""}
{"time": 1752465583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "110601955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=160276091]“……还真是，一点都看不出来”她湛蓝的眼睛终于愿意正眼盯着你，你能看出来，她失去的桀骜在一点点回归，无谓的迷惘在一点点散去。最后，她开口道"}
{"time": 1752465595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1492228331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我饿了”"}
{"time": 1752465624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680184368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（要吃五目炒饭，章鱼香肠和鬼金棒家的拉面）"}
{"time": 1752465628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "331217515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1487474028][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “啊？感觉不太可能吧，不过谢谢医生”"}
{"time": 1752465951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1571830781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=331217515]她没说话，只是静静地等血样里的反应慢慢发生，然后换一种试剂，再滴一次。如此这般，直到全都滴了个遍，她才松口气“反正，我这儿有的检测手段都用过了。结论是，和正常人的血液没有区别。你不是什么龙变的，大可安心。顺带一提，你的血型是AB型，要不要顺便捐一点？”"}
{"time": 1752466023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "777662937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1492228331]\"给你带了饭了。\"把装餐盘的盒子拿过来递给她，眨眨眼开口，\"另外，看不出来什么?\""}
{"time": 1752466214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "980711977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=777662937]“看着就软乎乎的，和古龙完全没有共同点啊”绘梨衣翻开餐盒盖，来不及先闻一口就抽出筷子吃了起来"}
{"time": 1752466361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "412052890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1571830781][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “不是一般o型的捐么”"}
{"time": 1752466464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051771062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=980711977]\"诶...我又没有刻意隐藏...\"转过身看夏弥，\"安和古龙真的联系不上吗？呜呜...\""}
{"time": 1752466550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "657705068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=412052890]“就是因为这么想的人多，所以血库才缺AB型啊”她屈指弹了弹你的额头"}
{"time": 1752466588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1225333475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2051771062]“唔唔……确实软乎乎的嘛”夏弥从半空落下来戳戳你的脸"}
{"time": 1752466637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1591292972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像有点道理”摸摸头"}
{"time": 1752466691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783139667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是...我的血不能给别人输...”"}
{"time": 1752466715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868005562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有人告诉我，沧澜变成人就是因为不小心喝了我的血...”"}
{"time": 1752466730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "778022926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（什么都说啊）"}
{"time": 1752466770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1126168625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(反正她知道的也不少了)"}
{"time": 1752466791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "959951958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（因为知道的多所以索性全说了？）"}
{"time": 1752466797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "54547949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不过我觉得她会以为我在开玩笑）"}
