{"time": 1752466869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1746387307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（纳尔嘎达）"}
{"time": 1752466882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "120591704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1868005562]“你说的那个朋友是不是你自己？”"}
{"time": 1752466963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "926923947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1225333475]鼓着脸不让她戳，伸手揉她的脸颊，\"夏弥才是软软的，唔...\""}
{"time": 1752467088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549568526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=120591704][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “哎呀，这不重要”"}
{"time": 1752467623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "953791939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“开玩笑的，本来我也没打算真的抽。”蝴蝶把你的血样和乱七八糟用过的试剂全都扫进废水槽，显然没法再分离“虽然我也没查出什么来吧，不过直觉告诉我，你的身体确实……与众不同，我又不能把你剖了，所以就算抽了血，我也不敢给别人输”"}
{"time": 1752467688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2105284715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=926923947]“只是对你来说是这样啦”夏弥软乎乎被戳"}
{"time": 1752468004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1105463646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "揉够了收回手自然地挽住手臂，转身问绘梨衣，\"绘梨衣之后打算?\""}
{"time": 1752468025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1192417468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧，谢谢医生了”"}
{"time": 1752468088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "961156883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，之前沧澜的以及后续的治疗的医疗费大概是多少”"}
{"time": 1752468394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422917286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1105463646]“打算？我的仇还没报上呢，没忘记我的条件吧”绘梨衣咽下一口晚饭“之后的事，报完了再想”"}
{"time": 1752468489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "162715994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=961156883]“哦，你当真要我细算？”蝴蝶打了个哈欠"}
{"time": 1752468514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "724221308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1422917286]\"今天明明...\"说了一半停住，笑着看她的表情"}
{"time": 1752468526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1056827676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“总不能白白麻烦你吧，医生也是要吃饭的”"}
{"time": 1752468718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "873040313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=724221308]她倒是一脸理所当然“干嘛，难道打不过就不打了吗？总有一天，我会赢的”"}
{"time": 1752468792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "587535351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好哦，也就是说，赢之前都打算跟着安咯?\""}
{"time": 1752468894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1105601934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1056827676]“秘药2000一颗，烧伤药膏成本价都1200一罐了，她这几天换一次药就是大半罐……你看着算吧”"}
{"time": 1752468930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065026502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我过几天在付款吧...”"}
{"time": 1752468959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1520551997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（欠了多少钱了，3哥）"}
{"time": 1752469062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "974803149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（1200+3000+10000，然后我身上有11000）"}
{"time": 1752469071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1319704035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（明天可以赚4500）"}
{"time": 1752469081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418708977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（然后在攒钱还医药费（）"}
{"time": 1752469134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1512455516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（幸好没请安吃饭，要不钱不够了）"}
{"time": 1752469312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "436724957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=587535351]“这个说法怎么听起来有点让人不爽……”绘梨衣眯了眯眼“虽然事实上应该是这样”"}
{"time": 1752469560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743135301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"看你恢复了精神倒是好事啦，好了。\"拍拍手，\"那我们就回去了，早点休息吧。最近应该要出趟远门。\""}
{"time": 1752469598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1479148236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2065026502]“随你，反正你才刚当上猎人不久吧”"}
{"time": 1752469625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800720414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那蝴蝶医生有什么委托吗，我可以帮你做的”"}
