{"time": 1752469890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1669527431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1743135301]“慢走不送……顺便帮我把这个带走”她把吃干净的餐盒顺手就拿到你面前"}
{"time": 1752469953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1681418638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...这也要我带吗？\"眼神哀怨地看着她，\"我又不是保姆...\""}
{"time": 1752470003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "877259807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“天色也不早了，我先回家了，明天见沧澜，明天见医生”与二人告别"}
{"time": 1752470034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1916511176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（露儿将与二人离别，唯其露儿可以回家（）"}
{"time": 1752470044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "553062663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“明明之前才叫我绘梨衣大人来着？”她挑眉，带着些得逞般的狡猾笑容"}
{"time": 1752470064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "726123987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1916511176]（神人）"}
{"time": 1752470295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801580385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=877259807]“医药费，我会自己想办法”你临走前，沧澜突然抬头跟你说"}
{"time": 1752470338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2087437513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=553062663]\"行吧...\"打个哈欠，接过来，\"明天见。\""}
{"time": 1752470485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1398743440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2087437513]“慢走不送~”她抬手带出一串气泡，代为送客了"}
{"time": 1752470513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "489767964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？没关系，我先帮你付了，你是在过意不去的话后面钱赚足够多了还我就是了”"}
