{"time": 1752475248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499314434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "第二天"}
{"time": 1752475265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "969498081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（距离世界毁灭还有1024次永劫轮回）"}
{"time": 1752475607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803328930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "依旧是一个无事发生的早晨。反正你们昨日也没有什么特别透支体力的活动"}
{"time": 1752475635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "679433490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "洗漱，换衣服，吃早饭"}
{"time": 1752475686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781407299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“早上好”给父亲打个招呼"}
{"time": 1752475716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1899725956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "第一反应是缩到旁边人的怀里，带着很重的倦意轻声开口，“呜...今天做什么...”"}
{"time": 1752476123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "926562295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1781407299]“早，露儿”彻一如往常，在桌边等着你来吃早饭。不过早餐倒是越来越均衡精致了"}
{"time": 1752476272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1600407567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1899725956]“没什么特别要做的啦……”夏弥揽着你“是个睡懒觉的好日子”"}
{"time": 1752476493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1581472627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1600407567]\"嗯...不想起...\"声音越来越小，\"再...睡一会...\"一直就没睁开过眼睛，脑袋微微一耷拉，再次睡了过去"}
{"time": 1752476555, "type": "recv", "message_id": "532022445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "吃完早饭，准备出门“走了父亲，我要出门狩猎了”"}
{"time": 1752476665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "157590465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉有人注定要跳过这天早上了）"}
{"time": 1752476763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1255661332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（你是对的）"}
{"time": 1752476849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952297093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（但是不跳的话，我在这天早上其实也是逛街）"}
{"time": 1752477200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1829200497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=532022445]“又去狩猎吗”他倒是没有意外的样子“偶尔不打算休息休息吗”"}
{"time": 1752477236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1622151275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“狩猎很有意思啊”"}
{"time": 1752477258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341179250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且不止我一个人 父亲不用担心了”"}
{"time": 1752477537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1733237559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”他也没多说什么，大概到了这个年纪，说的话总是离不开“注意安全”"}
{"time": 1752477553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1425043051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，再见”"}
{"time": 1752477563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1100091180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去铁匠铺取装备喽"}
{"time": 1752477746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2124821496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "镰蟹太刀的外形看起来倒真的有些像镰刀，寒光凛凛，栩栩如生（？）。经过调校，中心与常规刀具相差不大，但刀尖破甲能力更强"}
{"time": 1752477750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1707724949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（重心）"}
{"time": 1752477764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1003180669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好帅啊，谢谢铁匠大叔”"}
{"time": 1752478092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "948914359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“分内的事，能帮上忙就好咯”"}
{"time": 1752478317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250100288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（这把刀特效是什么来着）"}
{"time": 1752478330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "708205819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "下来去找沧澜了"}
