{"time": 1752490630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1053609700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=896024987]如沧澜所言，地下是几百个不善的目光——比上次少的多的多，但个头明显大一些"}
