{"time": 1752495624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53392460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "沧澜的周身闪耀起来，明亮的蓝色电弧在周身游走，像一大颗球状闪电，随后近乎无规则地喷发，像引爆一颗炸弹"}
{"time": 1752495679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "135854329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "影蜘蛛有些许畏缩，但并无大碍。小蜘蛛们则只剩下半群"}
{"time": 1752495711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467562664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好帅.....”"}
{"time": 1752495824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1524248286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=430840461]“嘛……”觉叹了口气“也是没办法的事。说不定不会是最后一次……”"}
{"time": 1752495841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639523053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（第三回合？）"}
{"time": 1752495843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153023004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过来都来了，先去看看吧？”"}
{"time": 1752495910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1365618599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1662889777]（什么意思，慢慢叠？[CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1752495967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1665994520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1524248286]\"不过比起之前那时候要好很多了，小觉待会可要帅气一点，不然那家伙不知道要怎么说我。\"放下手，\"走吧，下楼。\""}
{"time": 1752496052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "582324482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=135854329]“呼……喝……”雷光散去，徒留些许细小电弧偶有闪灭，沧澜的发型有些爆炸，还有些发喘，看起来负担不小。余下那群小蜘蛛也不敢靠近了"}
