{"time": 1752499254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "424108677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（死了感觉）"}
{"time": 1752499312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "125145144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1726531091]\"诶?\"似笑非笑看着她，\"为什么这么说?\""}
{"time": 1752499358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "195957690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但沧澜没给它这个机会，她踏步上前，在它喷丝之前一剑捅进它的腹部，崎岖的剑刃带出不明所以的器官和尚未成型的粘液"}
{"time": 1752499376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1371128153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（该到死而不僵的阶段了）"}
