{"time": 1752499437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634712587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=125145144]“一看就和那边那位是同类”绘梨衣朝着夏弥的方向努了努嘴"}
{"time": 1752499605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "279927775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=634712587]\"哦?从眼睛就能看出来?\"自己也试一试，弯下腰看看赫萝的眼睛，和印象里夏弥的对比一下"}
{"time": 1752499775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1224955928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=279927775]完全不一样，夏弥的眼睛除了底色是蓝色以外，形状和人类可以说相差无几。赫萝，则是标志性的竖瞳"}
{"time": 1752499866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "389405121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=279753226]影蜘蛛癫狂地做着最后挣扎，四足二鳌完全暴走，无差别攻击着周围"}
