{"time": 1752500441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "397505774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=734676177]“倒真是看得起我”绘梨衣倒也真绷得住，在两头人形古龙之前依旧面不改色“不过这还真是有意思，怎么做到的？你们……还有你”绘梨衣又看向觉“嗯……相比之下，感觉正常多了”"}
{"time": 1752500540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1769003452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=397505774]\"嘿嘿...但是觉是和我同样的存在哦?\"一脸笑容，轻巧地开口"}
{"time": 1752500600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1431557490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=269198121]总之，挣扎过后，影蜘蛛的躯体只剩抽搐的机能，被你补刀也不可能诈尸。而毒液也让你渐渐抬不动手臂"}
{"time": 1752500747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1520121319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去找沧澜，把药给她“对不起，都是因为我，你才受伤了”"}
{"time": 1752500928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336853918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有些断断续续的，带着哭腔"}
{"time": 1752501006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1738817096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1769003452]“但还是正常多了，嗯，而且看起来很厉害”她强调般点头“以后能陪我练手吗？”"}
{"time": 1752501092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747058154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你...还好吧，有没有加重之前的伤....对不起..”"}
{"time": 1752501258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "565851623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=747058154]“我没事，它牙尖嘴利，但对我来说只是小伤”它安慰般按了按你的脑袋，左侧臂甲有些碎裂，但的确没什么大事“看看你自己吧”"}
{"time": 1752501307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1753158661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我还好....你没事就行”长舒一口气"}
