{"time": 1752501430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045935769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1738817096]“找我练手吗？”觉笑了笑“没问题，不嫌弃我下不去手的话”"}
{"time": 1752501443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1734897311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1753158661]（还好在哪）"}
{"time": 1752501462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "882908020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1738817096]\"诶?绘梨衣是说我实力不济咯?\"眨眨眼，\"哼....小觉和我也差不多吧？\""}
{"time": 1752501537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2020499673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=797757612]肩甲在先前的撞击中已经碎裂，侧腰又在刚才的挣扎中被擦出一条伤到肌肉的伤口，各自往外渗着紫红色的毒血。喝了药还是觉得头晕眼花"}
{"time": 1752501638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1965889883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=882908020]（我和刀架子没什么好说的）"}
{"time": 1752501669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "41821392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1734897311]（之前受过更严重的伤？[CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1752501695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868237186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=882908020]“怎么说我也比你早出道一年嘛……要是没点本领在身上，要被人看不起了”"}
