{"time": 1752502046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946750077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2020499673]“你在流血”其实根本不用沧澜说，你也能知道"}
{"time": 1752502096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "565987060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“休息...一下就好了...沧澜，你把蜘蛛的素材取一下吧，我...有点累..”"}
{"time": 1752502311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1917486276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=584458584]“所以？现在要干嘛”绘梨衣站起身来“不是说要出远门？”"}
{"time": 1752502339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1766459643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=565987060]“呃……”沧澜第一次露出为难的表情“我……没做过这种事”"}
{"time": 1752502345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "403325629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?也不急吧，我还没吃早餐诶\""}
{"time": 1752502372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "173432109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那...我来吧..没关系”拖着身子过去开始解剖"}
{"time": 1752502691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1249088959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=403325629]“那你快点……真稀奇，为什么你们都一副和她是好朋友的样子？”绘梨衣保持着站姿，似乎是有些不甘地发问"}
{"time": 1752502831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2074062948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=173432109]“反正这儿也没别的人，先上去修整吧”沧澜拽住你“又不会长出翅膀来”"}
{"time": 1752503056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2003865624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1249088959]\"有什么奇怪的吗？\"戳戳自己的脸颊，安心等着菜上桌"}
{"time": 1752503084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2099452144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，早餐.exe"}
