{"time": 1752510350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1790854414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总之）"}
{"time": 1752510484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2028410497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "从结云村出发前往炎火村，需要途径两块猎场，其一为III号，其二为IIIE号，其中e代表III号猎场的5点钟方向——扇区角度不变，但半径增大，显然要大的多"}
{"time": 1752510563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1985374980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "总之也不是很急，慢慢走过去咯"}
{"time": 1752510607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1229650459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但那暂时无关紧要，你们才刚进入III号猎场，人类还没来得及开始出汗，视觉还没对绿色感到疲劳，蓝天的碎片就出现在地上——并不是蓝天，那是海洋的一角"}
{"time": 1752510616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1408995450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "是沧澜，你见过的"}
{"time": 1752510692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593034681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（难道是打沧澜？）"}
{"time": 1752510710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1826650461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（别老想那么邪恶的事情）"}
{"time": 1752510725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1239958368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你不是说邪恶的不得了）"}
{"time": 1752510726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "889529923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "背上背着另一个灰头土脸的人"}
{"time": 1752510769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "551752301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶...那诗？”"}
{"time": 1752510784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1921014902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（最邪恶的难道是打我？）"}
{"time": 1752510840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "507408201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（还真有可能）"}
{"time": 1752510896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "226214916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "慢慢靠过去看看，远远打个招呼"}
{"time": 1752510955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1284631069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "沧澜也不算全须全尾。说不上狼狈，但看起来步伐的确有些赶"}
{"time": 1752511028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1793188478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“怎么了？”"}
{"time": 1752511073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146936140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（其实只是在睡觉（）"}
{"time": 1752511081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "530236854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是你们？”即便注意力不在路上，沧澜也不至于迟钝到听不见呼唤。隔着有段距离，她开口，但似乎没打算停下来许久“她受伤了，还中了毒”"}
{"time": 1752511254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "679247343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“中毒？”凑过去，“嘶...我这里带了解毒剂，让我看看？”"}
{"time": 1752511335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530768369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”沧澜略微慢了些，不过看起来没有打算完全停下来。她的意思是给你个机会“是蜘蛛毒”"}
{"time": 1752511336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1230764992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“这是去干什么了？”皱着眉，“这附近有带毒的怪物吗”"}
{"time": 1752511471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40501010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "从包里拿出解毒剂，撬开露儿的嘴灌进去，仔细看一眼伤口，“嗯...”"}
{"time": 1752511534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660090149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "虽然有心想说两句她两的莽撞，但是显然不是时候，咂咂嘴，“真够狠的”"}
{"time": 1752511582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005811158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "侧腰处像是被钉耙犁过，近似的两列齿痕下是红色的皮肤外壳"}
{"time": 1752511599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010282557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "而凶器就在背包里，一半露在外面"}
{"time": 1752511671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162435962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=6708929D6AA0B631B0AE36F71C61481D.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTz_dyu2nQxHH2yGqxbSuG4MWAnoBjq6Acg_woo1avL3Oa8jgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQovyJwSm1CKG2zZmsh7pxeHoCrT0&amp;rkey=CAESMJfcCDf3SVhMj3SkM39OvgC4xNyfhy8iH8Mmd-oJH_PZroWzcg4F2iAFxQrG1jlXlQ,file_size=128106]"}
{"time": 1752511675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1425808673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "探查一下脉搏，观察伤口的血液颜色，查证解毒剂有没有生效"}
{"time": 1752511675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1583543473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这条）"}
{"time": 1752511684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "118626752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（原来是这个东西）"}
{"time": 1752511783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1449640577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1425808673]大概是有，出血性毒素旨在阻止伤口凝血，现在血流终于变缓"}
{"time": 1752511932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "91007699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "想了想再给她灌一瓶解毒剂，“我已经简单处理了一下...这家伙命还算大，啧，看来今天的行程要被打断了。”"}
{"time": 1752512017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1874300919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“诶，这才刚出门……”第一个不高兴的当然是赫萝"}
{"time": 1752512118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1463529181", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“在给人添麻烦这件事上，还真是...从来都是...”摇摇头，看向赫萝一行“也不是完全取消啦，我和夏弥先把这丫头送回去，马上回来。”"}
{"time": 1752512216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1464207264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“稳住了的话，我自己就够”沧澜似乎是舒了口气"}
{"time": 1752512222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1480914976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "至于露儿"}
{"time": 1752512316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "222231397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你的意识依旧在沉浮之中。这么说不准确——你的意识在下潜，潜意识在上浮，现在身体是你的大脑，而大脑恰好相反"}
