{"time": 1752514918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1369221211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1338459596]“咳……咳咳……我们去，讨伐了一只影蜘蛛……但是它垂死挣扎的时候，我们都受了伤……还中了毒”"}
