{"time": 1752515709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "534191728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦……醒了，感觉怎么样？”你睁眼，看见的依旧是熟悉的面容，不知为何眼角泛红"}
