{"time": 1752515891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "505020863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(包括自己)"}
{"time": 1752515896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "819464958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(一起走咯)"}
{"time": 1752515916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1408797902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1149490931]大概还没来得及走远"}
{"time": 1752515974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1872402578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐一定很生气吧，我还是之后再去感谢她吧....”"}
{"time": 1752515992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122920654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“把我放下来吧沧澜，我感觉好多了”"}
{"time": 1752516026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "571157085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，你不是也中了那下，你的毒怎么样了”"}
{"time": 1752516034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498443109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你看见我了不来一个弗雷尔卓德告别)"}
{"time": 1752516102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1292833660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1122920654]“嗯”她轻轻放下你，腰背又挺得笔直“啊……刚才忘记要解毒药了”"}
{"time": 1752516199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1238572556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起，都怪我，我没有准备充分就带你来了，而且不是我的话，你也不会受伤...”看看安走远了吗"}
{"time": 1752516284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433300536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1238572556]起码远未脱离视觉范围"}
{"time": 1752516314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256750620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“等下我..沧澜，你先休息一下”"}
{"time": 1752516321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "843184495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去追安"}
