{"time": 1752516584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "167017773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐，等一下，安姐姐..”"}
{"time": 1752516674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2015985695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...?是我们走得不够快吗？”无奈地回过身，“别跑了，怎么了”"}
{"time": 1752516725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "389657047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢你又救了我..安姐姐，然后...解毒剂还有吗，沧澜也中毒了..”"}
{"time": 1752516822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1744047453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "几乎是有些咬牙切齿，“...有..”"}
{"time": 1752516847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "377778210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起...”不敢抬头看她"}
{"time": 1752516980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785495841", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "从包里翻出两瓶递给她，\"我要去炎火待几天...回来的时候露儿还能活着好像也是个问题呢？\""}
{"time": 1752516992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "225396427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "从包里翻出两瓶递给她，\"我要去炎火待几天...回来的时候露儿能不能活着好像也是个问题呢？\""}
{"time": 1752517013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "759902376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“........”接过药，不敢说话"}
{"time": 1752517174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1863541707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"为什么不说话?\"眯着眼，微笑，\"刚刚不是还在喊我吗？\""}
{"time": 1752517198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "776481544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我会好好反省的..”"}
