{"time": 1752520764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974762204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=909217044]“不知道，也许……等她再救一次什么人吧”夏弥闭上眼，靠在你肩膀上“不过她暂时好像没有这种余裕呢”"}
{"time": 1752520832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "632674382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=477642839]“嗯……”沧澜没想太久，就点了点头“一起去吧。已经有些习惯了”"}
{"time": 1752520863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "30537689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢你，对了，我有个礼物要送你”"}
{"time": 1752520887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1927556213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "踮起脚尖帮沧澜戴上那个项链"}
{"time": 1752521000, "type": "recv", "message_id": "36006839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1927556213]“喔……这是？”她低头，把那枚带着小翅膀的鳞片拿起来看了几眼“给我？”"}
{"time": 1752521007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "784785350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后自己戴上另一个“我们一人一个，是...emmm..坚不可摧的友情的见证...嗯..是这样”"}
{"time": 1752521059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1751652918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1974762204]握住夏弥的手十指紧扣，脑袋靠着脑袋，\"...上次还说要带她见见岚，现在看来，这件事还是算了比较好吧？\""}
{"time": 1752521139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "409091666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=784785350]“有些微妙的感觉，有些凉，有些酥麻，不过……不知道为什么又有些温暖，谢谢”她点点头"}
{"time": 1752521154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1586030134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你是不是还没去衣服店）"}
{"time": 1752521160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016111554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你喜欢就好”"}
{"time": 1752521172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "729721301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（本来准备去的，但想想时间会不会太长了）"}
{"time": 1752521179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "672681064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（来得及就去）"}
{"time": 1752521196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808092189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“医生，蝴蝶医生在吗”找找医生"}
{"time": 1752521197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533494852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（取衣服才多久）"}
{"time": 1752521210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617822107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（要一分钟吗）"}
{"time": 1752521217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266472986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（也对）"}
{"time": 1752521240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1986153518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1808092189]“在在在，我哪天不在？”蝴蝶还在她的老位置"}
{"time": 1752521257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1142240965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我和沧澜准备出几天远门”"}
{"time": 1752521281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "381429722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以吗”"}
{"time": 1752521339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "566132184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯？沧澜的伤倒是已经稳……怎么回事，添了新伤？”"}
{"time": 1752521375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1060853335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们去狩猎了，不小心受了一点伤，不过问题应该不大”"}
{"time": 1752521449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "322750547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那出远门是要去哪？哎，我问你这个干什么，我又不是你监护人……”"}
{"time": 1752521493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1704350685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“算了，这个拿着”蝴蝶给你两罐子外用伤药"}
{"time": 1752521500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715382125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不用我教你怎么用吧”"}
{"time": 1752521501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2049614478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“去炎火村，有上位猎人陪同，医生不用担心”"}
{"time": 1752521510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1670650704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢医生”接过来"}
{"time": 1752521637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989289049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行了行了，小兔崽子。没别的事就该干啥干啥去”"}
{"time": 1752521654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400447466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“医生再见”"}
{"time": 1752521708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821284973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "下来去衣服店取一下衣服，最后回家带几件衣服然后给父亲留个讯息，随后出发"}
{"time": 1752521732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "597476386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还真是，你爹不在家我还能少编两句）"}
{"time": 1752521758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749441257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那你的影蜘蛛素材呢）"}
{"time": 1752521772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038274815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（在集会所直接卖了）"}
