{"time": 1752521822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175134573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（OK）"}
{"time": 1752521898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989615992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1751652918]\"就算真的要面对，也该是我一个人去的。\"补上这么一句，看了看在场的人，\"卷入其他人...多少有些不负责。\""}
