{"time": 1752558888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1143319980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=376110100]“唔唔……花言巧语。夏弥啊夏弥，不可以傻乎乎被骗了哦”夏弥把脸缩到领子里，叽里咕噜对自己说"}
{"time": 1752558907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1124891964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我和龙性恋没什么好说的）"}
{"time": 1752559082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1742929197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一到m坐下就听到有毛有翼）"}
{"time": 1752559087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1434178033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1143319980]\"诶?\"捧起她的脸揉揉，\"这可是真心话，哪里是花言巧语啦?不过呢...\"看着手上的戒指，\"都这样啦，还有骗不骗的说法吗？\"笑容明媚"}
{"time": 1752559100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1395376050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我在想，我要不要也去m吃饭)"}
