{"time": 1752559425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688271407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1434178033]“唔嗯~”夏弥眯着眼，露出惬意的表情“安是不是……第一个让风为其驻足的人类？”"}
{"time": 1752560022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "289935477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1688271407]\"那夏弥可要做好准备。\"挠挠她的下巴，\"这次驻足可是会很久很久呢？\""}
