{"time": 1752562142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1518899251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1752562161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081144814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐....我们回来...了”气喘吁吁"}
{"time": 1752562293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "603541212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "最后掐掐夏弥的脸，收回手看向她们的样子不免有些好笑，\"有够赶的?\""}
{"time": 1752562356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635390439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没有....太...耽误到..大家吧”"}
{"time": 1752562536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700159440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "前后大概一个半小时，就2天起步的路程来说倒不算什么了"}
{"time": 1752562560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1873023169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"被你耽误的也不差这点了。\"伸个懒腰"}
{"time": 1752562618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095223075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对..对不起”"}
{"time": 1752562902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063579368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"道歉无用哦?走吧\""}
{"time": 1752562934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2074763302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“oh...”终于缓过来了 默默的跟上"}
{"time": 1752563249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741460377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你的意思是）"}
{"time": 1752563252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "631952538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（要开始）"}
{"time": 1752563255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461724697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（景物描写了？）"}
{"time": 1752563574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "915423104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd10"}
{"time": 1752563574, "type": "reply", "message_id": "915423104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]演奏出: 1D10=6"}
{"time": 1752564158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1538469116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(time leap)"}
{"time": 1752564172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308978095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（什么意思）"}
{"time": 1752564209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2140489976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "春天的阳光都带着花香，大抵是一年之中最适合在林间穿行的时日。结云村通向炎火村的路途被尽量修得平直，但不免得绕过山体——可惜没有水系直连两座村子\n按着地图，你们沿着几乎被犁出车辙的道路行于大地，行于山间，行于天地之间。望北，层峦叠嶂，乱石穿空。饥渴的绿色触肢攀缘其上，比人类还渴望触及天空。望南，百川赴海，浓翠蔽日。会动的反倒是弱势群体，被迫张扬地彰显存在"}
{"time": 1752564344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898765438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"总算有了点郊游的感觉了。\""}
{"time": 1752564483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1559827082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "说是这么说，还是尽量保持淑女一些，让自己不显得欢呼雀跃。"}
{"time": 1752564591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1690896869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "而向前……向前，与太阳的轨迹相撞，你们此行注定西升东落，踏碎每一片映着太阳的积水，在众生的拱卫中去往下一个地界。在终点的下一站，喷烟的火山是太阳的起点，但那与你们无关。在那之前，采花、踏青、无穷会动的都与你们有关。至少精灵鹿会和你们走在同一条道上，轻嗅你们包里的药草气味，然后拿钱办事，充当你们的警报器"}
{"time": 1752564639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "816973417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摸摸鹿头"}
{"time": 1752564915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "378434676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不喂不给摸"}
{"time": 1752565049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "119768785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说起来...在山道上要是铺上泡沫，是不是一路滑下去?\""}
{"time": 1752565051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1443690473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "从包中拿出一直没用的药草投喂“这下可以摸了吧”"}
{"time": 1752565372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "612606551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（并非直道（）"}
{"time": 1752565401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2027624696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=119768785]“你在问谁？”绘梨衣回头"}
{"time": 1752565419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1937087076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1443690473]趁还没吃完的时候，也许可以多摸一摸"}
{"time": 1752565493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2122393837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"问你咯。\"笑，\"不过好像有点危险，万一滑过头掉下去就麻烦了。\""}
{"time": 1752565568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "632465566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真贪吃啊”摸摸头“这是谁家的小鹿呀”"}
{"time": 1752565999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1787591367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2122393837]“反正我只负责放泡泡，滑不明白就不能怪我了哦”"}
{"time": 1752566188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140393210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...那也可以吧，这种事不试试怎么知道自己有没有天赋?\"跃跃欲试"}
{"time": 1752566543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "173083720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=632465566]鹿自然不会回答你，沧澜似乎也有些兴趣"}
{"time": 1752566598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961141036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这鹿感觉还蛮乖的，沧澜你也来看看吧”"}
{"time": 1752567350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "927716790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=140393210]“随你，那就等着吃我尾气吧”绘梨衣双手一拍，在阳光下光华流转，随后落在地面上，华美中带着刺激性十足的教唆"}
{"time": 1752567362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1199033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我还以为你在粥呢）"}
{"time": 1752567487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433384741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1961141036]沧澜学着你的样子，一手拿着药草，一手轻柔地抚摸无害的小家伙“唔……毛茸茸的，不错不错……总感觉可以养一只”"}
{"time": 1752567511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1102480426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1199033]（你以为的是对的）"}
{"time": 1752567527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1372088077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“原来你还喜欢小动物吗”"}
