{"time": 1752578187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831781301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……不知道这毛是捕食者的还是猎物的”觉伏在地上瞅了瞅“不过感觉不算很大，也就和狼……我是说狼，差不多？”"}
{"time": 1752578372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116827588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"觉觉得是鸟龙吗？\""}
