{"time": 1752579103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533664490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1082494816]“谢谢”沧澜仰头饮下两三口。看起来也不完全是这方面的原因“空气，太湿了……而且好挤”"}
{"time": 1752579180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494538092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "太小了很难去感同身受"}
