{"time": 1752579694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1324847617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "其实是一大块茂密的台地，没有什么高峰，也因此风吹不太上来"}
