{"time": 1752589996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1385391960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（醒了啊）"}
{"time": 1752590218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1077860299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1912038923]\"唔...\"捂着脑袋，\"怎么了...怎么在地上\""}
{"time": 1752593067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1406553109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“刚刚有只眠鸟，你们都把它的雾弄昏睡了”"}
{"time": 1752593085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839338317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过已经死了现在”"}
{"time": 1752593254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1957786238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“唔嗯……抱歉”夏弥缩起肩膀，看起来小下去一圈“没能及时发现……”"}
{"time": 1752593796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648752796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（晚上还有吗）"}
{"time": 1752593820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631485780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不一定）"}
{"time": 1752593833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1911287483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那睡了）"}
{"time": 1752594613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "199252150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1406553109]\"...咦，那好像是我们的任务目标?是露儿打倒的吗？\"抬起身子，\"大家，有受伤吗？\""}
{"time": 1752594761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968329446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=199252150]“应该……还没有。它死的很快”夏弥瞥了被开颅的眠鸟一眼“赫萝和露儿没被睡着，一下子就解决了”"}
{"time": 1752595078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "252913045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“多亏了赫萝姐姐和夏弥姐姐，我才能很快解决”"}
{"time": 1752595193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1511919201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=252913045]\"哇哦，安不够谨慎...\"从地方爬起来，\"嗯，露儿也做得很好。\"去看看那只眠鸟"}
{"time": 1752595375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1249604177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1511919201]胸口凹下去一块，伤口处如同火山的大地一般，龟裂处泛着淡淡的红光。此外头上有一处直接破坏了大脑的刀口"}
{"time": 1752595388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1503943978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "此外倒是相当完整"}
{"time": 1752595492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1102425254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"目标是...尾巴上的羽毛来着..\"去看看尾羽，拔下来，\"露儿，过来拿素材吧？\""}
{"time": 1752595590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "971718348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那谢谢安姐姐了”扒素材"}
{"time": 1752595635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "168072935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"之后路上也要多多小心呢...\"数了一下中招的人数，\"我们这么多人，居然几乎都倒了\""}
{"time": 1752595699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "289777691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“结果还不是一下子解决了，什么时候才能遇到有意思点的家伙？”赫萝骑到眠鸟背上晃了晃腿“我都想去天上找了”"}
{"time": 1752595700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035987778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "还有些淡淡的眩晕感，捂着脑袋"}
{"time": 1752595784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1540249595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "沧澜也扶着脑袋“唔……居然我也……睡过去了？”"}
{"time": 1752595913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "930128244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "踮起脚尖摸摸沧澜的头“没关系哦，露儿会保护你的”"}
{"time": 1752595948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "753335237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=289777691]\"嘛，本来比赫萝强的怪物就不多嘛。\"走过去把她拉下来，摸摸脑袋，\"干得好，当然啦，之后会有一场怎么都会尽兴的遭遇的。\"眨眨眼"}
{"time": 1752595971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1318068172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "示意露儿现在去整理背上的素材"}
{"time": 1752596024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462616477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呃嗯……这次大意了……没经历过这种情况”沧澜摇摇头“下次一定不会……”"}
{"time": 1752596152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "684004490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "继续去扒素材"}
{"time": 1752596370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1481471299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "除了任务指定要求的尾羽外，爪与喙自不必说，体内的眠袋才是最值钱的玩意。其睡眠效力远超人鱼龙"}
{"time": 1752596538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1251922082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"后面应该还要处理一只尾锤龙，不过只是驱逐任务，感觉有必要下死手吗？\""}
{"time": 1752596726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2086224371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（首先排除问我）"}
{"time": 1752596811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160939058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（难道是问我？）"}
{"time": 1752596822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "887076426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我这么菜也决定不了啊）"}
{"time": 1752596831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1776189331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1752596861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1922041217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那你觉得我的npc们会关心任务吗）"}
{"time": 1752596880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1484395792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，安姐姐决定吧”"}
{"time": 1752596958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "561204013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"待会看看?主要看一个眼缘对不对?\""}
{"time": 1752596980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382332062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐想把它变人？”"}
{"time": 1752596998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1321594546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过没有必要的话，最好不要杀生啦。\"拍拍脸，打起精神，\"我们继续赶路吧。\"听完她的话，\"不要，怎么这么想?\""}
{"time": 1752597149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226375556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也不知道，忽然就冒出了这个念头...”"}
{"time": 1752597258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968544979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我倒是觉得我们的队伍已经……够大了”觉点了点人数"}
{"time": 1752597381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461625698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，没有这个必要哦?而且，安很长一段时间都不想干了。\"停了一会，\"露儿要是愿意可以试试，我不会拦着。\"边说边迈步离开，\"走吧。\""}
{"time": 1752597403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "535133634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？有沧澜陪着我就够了”"}
{"time": 1752597576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "620192272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，被眠鸟这么一耽搁，原本就开始染上昏黄的天空又暗下去几分"}
{"time": 1752597598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "563435644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那就不要想这个事了，动动脚。\"看眼天色，\"下了这个高地找个地方歇脚吧。\""}
{"time": 1752597599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598859447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "太阳已经有一半落到山头后面了"}
{"time": 1752597612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "451322832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，就听安姐姐的”"}
{"time": 1752597812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702637677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "台地边缘看着不远，不过毕竟缺乏参照物的你们也估不准，结果又走了半个多小时，看着离边缘还差一些，天色却已经完全暗下来了"}
{"time": 1752597839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2039574376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“天黑的好快啊，要赶夜路吗”"}
{"time": 1752597873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1995359521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "星光被枝叶遮挡，叶下只有些许昆虫和真菌的冷光"}
{"time": 1752597932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1548938630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...还是先下去吧。\"从包里拿出夜灯，点亮挂在腰间，\"我走前面咯。\""}
{"time": 1752597954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "365199908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟在后面"}
{"time": 1752598030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "135759859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥，你的小动作好少）"}
{"time": 1752598058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1679532178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1752598076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "984543818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我们都是说话穿插动作的（）"}
{"time": 1752598121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "630221644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"刚刚入夜的时候...应该还没那么危险，加把劲先下山吧。\""}
{"time": 1752598138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1317243221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哪来的危险.jpg）"}
{"time": 1752598193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "853655491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好”其实有些累的，但问题不大，拍拍自己的脸，让自己精神一些，快步跟上安"}
{"time": 1752598218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "287093776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可以了吧，说话穿插心理描写，穿插动作）"}
{"time": 1752598224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767018227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（善）"}
{"time": 1752598330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749752759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呼……还行，不算难走”觉点燃驱蚊熏香，或许有一半是为了提神“不过你们……不饿吗？总感觉上次吃饭还在早上……”"}
{"time": 1752598435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1321419230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶，还好啊。\"回过头，\"哦，我吃的午饭。小觉对不起啦，嘻嘻\""}
{"time": 1752598560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "350612782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我其实还好...不知道为什么不怎么饿”看向沧澜“你呢，沧澜，今天辛苦你了🥺”"}
{"time": 1752598684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1239145493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=350612782]“没什么，但确实有点饿，不过我看大家好像都没说，差点以为是我的问题”她摇摇头"}
{"time": 1752599031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "51216422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这里有什么吃的吗？”"}
{"time": 1752599053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858438032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（眠鸟肉忘割了）"}
{"time": 1752599064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1491577723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（对啊）"}
{"time": 1752599080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1295024063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（当时在旁边就可以休息，你们完全没人提）"}
{"time": 1752599112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "923553991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "四处看看，有没有小溪之类的"}
{"time": 1752599115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266960558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好像我们刚刚路过了晚餐来着?要是饿的话先拿干粮吧？\"收起开玩笑的态度，拿出包里的饼干"}
{"time": 1752599127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "439220594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（又又烤鱼？）"}
{"time": 1752599143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "793927015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（没办法啊，烤鱼确实是最简单的）"}
{"time": 1752599163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "152971694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（而且我直接感知抓鱼，天黑也能抓到（）"}
{"time": 1752599167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "894711849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们在高处的台地，自然不会有溪流"}
{"time": 1752599188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2105807010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=152971694]（错，你那天之后哪有这种能力）"}
{"time": 1752599305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558085883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来给我剥夺了（）"}
{"time": 1752599428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2102671102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=266960558]她倒是没有跟你客气的意思，接到手中简单道谢之后就啃了起来"}
{"time": 1752599530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1667039845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=558085883]（不属于你的力量（）"}
{"time": 1752599571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "714880315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呼...快速下山吧。\""}
{"time": 1752599600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1620653991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "依靠腰间的夜灯照明，沿着前人开辟的道路下山"}
{"time": 1752599602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42763063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "从背包中拿出干粮“你们饿的话，我这里也有些吃的”塞给沧澜一点“还有人要吗”"}
{"time": 1752599956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "965233357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "赫萝看起来并不在意，明明之前的战斗场面那么大。至于夏弥，她礼貌地和你摆摆手“我还不饿啦”。觉拿出肉干和你换了些。至于绘梨衣……她稍微闻了闻就转走了"}
{"time": 1752600075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928563396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"虽然错过了那只眠鸟，不过能下山的话，找条溪流夜钓是不是也别有风味?\"挥挥手，带着夜灯加快脚步"}
{"time": 1752600190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1787018598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎，不靠谱的大人”她轻跳两步就到了队伍最前面。前方的距离终于有了意义，倒数着豁然开朗的计时"}
{"time": 1752600382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727794849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"难道是我的错吗？毕竟台地很热嘛。早点下山会舒服很多。\""}
{"time": 1752600395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1439086999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "两侧的树丛突兀地不再延伸……无需抬头，皓月与星海只要平视就能尽收眼底。这里是台地的边缘，前方的路变得蜿蜒，因为下坡的坡度对车队来说太大。也因如此，为了开辟多曲折的下山道路，周围的树木多被清空"}
{"time": 1752600399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "984766156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总之就是）"}
{"time": 1752600411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "322779798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（发卡弯，盘山公路，应该都懂吧）"}
{"time": 1752600419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "344740524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1752600489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1457318878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=B7325D763A08621AE092864F6B64C621.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRL9WYBg1JD6wYDUQKZ1jfNlUA2ShiLayD_CiiSvtDMsb-OAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhA8vyvqTkGXf_dg6ddj4PJvegI5jQ&amp;rkey=CAESMBqadl5heujtLXs1XsJ-BMwYOicVChpgrwBcdSMzuhaETtG7rU623qfIC3thuB-dkQ,file_size=13707]"}
{"time": 1752600494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "943922328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你给小龙女洗脑了？）"}
{"time": 1752600498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "541385284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(无敌了)"}
{"time": 1752600499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1047061175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11796938CEFE037F3F7513B6B6602D72.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRuaue9_fsod0NxtZ5XtSBjo9YsTRjXmxQg_woosp2e0bG_jgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ_0N9s9XMFqvOwMUKRLPfq3oCtoU&amp;rkey=CAESMBqadl5heujtLXs1XsJ-BMwYOicVChpgrwBcdSMzuhaETtG7rU623qfIC3thuB-dkQ,file_size=331223]"}
{"time": 1752600501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1544737013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1752600531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1782385598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1439086999]\"诶...那岂不是还要转来转去?\"停在路边缘看着底下，借着月色看看距离"}
{"time": 1752600552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005390925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "对人来说，直接走直线也不是不能接受"}
{"time": 1752600611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "291624555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "抬头看看天“幸好今天天气不错，月亮还蛮亮的”"}
{"time": 1752600633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "166342945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呼……豁然开朗啊，明明林子里氧气才应该更充足才对”觉站在台地边缘，伸展四肢长出一口气“但是出了林子反而觉得终于能喘上气来了”"}
{"time": 1752600704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "101856721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毕竟被树丛遮住阳光，难免会觉得烦躁，有种密闭的不适感。\""}
{"time": 1752600725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1363936836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "指着路的斜坡，\"绘梨衣放点泡沫怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1752600736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1064791054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"滑草啦滑草\""}
{"time": 1752600915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593699908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这坡可陡多了”绘梨衣往下瞅了眼，月光下能看出“捷径”的坡度接近30°“反正后果自负咯”"}
{"time": 1752600924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1368857859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“会不会有点危险”看着蜿蜒的道路咽了咽口水"}
{"time": 1752601043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1493201433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1593699908]她又变魔术般甩出一长串泡沫，不过大概不够直达山下，于是她一马当先，边走路边修路……这下确实没人能滑过她了"}
{"time": 1752601053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1907160192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+5+4 滑！"}
