{"time": 1752639571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "586809116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1996024528]\"诶...这不是耍赖吗？\"缩回脑袋，\"不算不算啦。\""}
{"time": 1752639644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172797104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=287997780]河流的落差不大，往上走也几乎是平地。游鱼有，但依旧不算多。不过确实有你想象中的大家伙的足印。足印很深，只有三根粗短的脚趾……当然短是相较脚掌长度而言"}
{"time": 1752639688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "285047393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“晚饭感觉有可能有着落了”开心的仔细观察一下"}
{"time": 1752639698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2027977783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd-2 怪物常识"}
{"time": 1752639698, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2027977783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[露儿]使用[怪物常识]演奏出:[1D20-2={20}-2=18]"}
{"time": 1752639761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "505992503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=586809116]“原来是在和我捉迷藏？”夏弥眨眨眼“抱歉嘛……我还以为你在等晚餐”"}
{"time": 1752639871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883977720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=505992503]\"真是的。\"从树后走出来，\"夏弥这就是耍赖啦。\""}
{"time": 1752640021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "740840135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "嘟着嘴，\"还想吓你一跳来着。\"走到她面前掐着她的两边脸颊揉搓，\"运气好差，什么都没找到。\""}
{"time": 1752640027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904247640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=285047393]作为晚饭来说，大概不是很合格，毕竟光是脚印就和你一般长。能看出这家伙是双足行走，此外行进路上的树木多有被碰撞折断甚至啃食的痕迹……大概不会错了，足印的主人便是尾槌龙"}
{"time": 1752640127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "486725721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？”揉揉眼睛仔细看看“居然是尾锤龙，快回去通知大家吧”"}
{"time": 1752640152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1650060446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回营地"}
