{"time": 1752644775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1127766486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "时间有限，自然是以烤为主。不过毕竟旁边就是溪流，不煮点什么又说不过去……大概是蒜蓉小龙虾"}
{"time": 1752645098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "454651193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=307611195]（觉当然也有）"}
{"time": 1752645175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "171283632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"算了，不想了。\"凑到火边准备用餐"}
{"time": 1752645618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441132391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "炊烟弥漫，香气也逐渐扩散。你们是否习惯暂且不说，两个涉世未深的家伙视线已经挪不开了"}
{"time": 1752645850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1577485718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，还要熬一会，别那么急啦。\"悠闲地烤着火，抬头看看野外的星空"}
{"time": 1752645913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1855865037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“到了我最喜欢的环节...”"}
