{"time": 1752649960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "231596368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1872891833]（有品的家伙[CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1752650043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1856302774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“沧澜，你要和着兔子玩吗”一只手喂兔子，另一只手切点鹿肉吃"}
{"time": 1752650043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "14870603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...倒是好久没吃过烤肉了\"淑女地小口吃，略有些矜持，\"这一次出门的准备丰富，调味料足够果然很好吃\""}
{"time": 1752650085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "909251484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1375787050]夏弥乖巧接过，当磨牙一样嚼起来。绘梨衣似乎是嫌鹿肉太油，浅尝了些就回去对付她更偏爱的鱼肉了"}
{"time": 1752650326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "875983443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1856302774]“嗯……没事”沧澜只是趁你投喂的时候抚摸兔子无暇顾及的脑袋和背部“它听得懂你说话吗？”"}
{"time": 1752650350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "544892364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不知道啊”"}
