{"time": 1752650586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1471456113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=75294198]“那为……算了，没事”沧澜问到一半选择打住，随后接着啃鹿肉了“嗯……整个的啃起来确实……有满足感”"}
{"time": 1752650769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1626994320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我自己先去看看就好啦。\""}
{"time": 1752650771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266545354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=934374320]“去找尾锤龙吗？保险起见，还是多些人吧，虽然……”觉抬头看了看配置“有夏弥或者……赫萝的话，很难出事。不过我姑且也是猎人，得多依靠自己一些吧”"}
{"time": 1752650833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "680062441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那就都去？”"}
{"time": 1752650852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2036040707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"放心啦，我只是过去看看，不会打起来的。\"安抚一下觉，收拾一下佩剑，\"有什么事你们吃完饭再说。\"给夏弥示意一个不用担心的眼神，走过去看看"}
{"time": 1752650941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "9610314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（真不用担心吗）"}
