{"time": 1752651340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428373536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"当然啦，安怎么会出事。\"扬了扬脑袋，\"我就近看看，待会见。\"钻进林子"}
