{"time": 1752652327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391927793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我倒是无所谓，不过感觉沧澜挺喜欢的）"}
{"time": 1752652504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1727192974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "手心里握着零玉，簪子和风铃一起发出响动，看上去倒是心情很好，\"有种小时候悄悄探险的感觉。\""}
