{"time": 1752662280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "259628945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "尾槌龙阵阵抽搐，最后倒地，失去了生息"}
{"time": 1752662330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2071882103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...做到了吗...居然击败了这么大的龙吗.....”看着倒地的尾锤龙久久没有缓过来"}
{"time": 1752662537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594328934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"做得好\""}
{"time": 1752662553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1135489877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "其实感觉内脏还是不太舒服，捂着肚子"}
{"time": 1752662632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522334845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是大家的功劳，我一个人肯定不可能做得到的”扭头看安姐姐“安姐姐没事吧”急忙走到身前，拿出药“安姐姐快喝，喝完应该能好受点”"}
{"time": 1752662728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1931640016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...嗯...没什么，只有有些难受\""}
{"time": 1752662831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1555880998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不要逞强啦……受伤了就好好喝药嘛”夏弥拍拍你的肩膀"}
{"time": 1752662990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "417199553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看见夏弥来了把药塞给安姐姐自觉后退，看看沧澜怎么样"}
{"time": 1752663104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1334824322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=417199553]前胸的盔甲多少有些裂纹，不过没什么事，还能好好站着"}
{"time": 1752663127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1497623248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"小口喝着药，\"只是一些内伤啦...\""}
{"time": 1752663153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1621100210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "也掏瓶药递给沧澜“还好吗”"}
{"time": 1752663318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035761503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"夏弥也不用太着急，我还好的。\""}
{"time": 1752663331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228162323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1621100210]“还好，它力气比我想象的还大”沧澜接过药，她从不和你客气，仰头两口喝掉“现在好些了，没什么事……刚才不错，露儿”"}
{"time": 1752663359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876302210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢....”很开心又有点害羞"}
