{"time": 1752664399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "574147058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟过去"}
{"time": 1752664422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767027855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过这龙真的大啊，感觉可以扒下来好多好多素材”"}
{"time": 1752664482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1185660606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "体型就这个种族来说，中规中矩。角上没有太多伤痕，不过断下的半根还卡在树干上。听说也有美食家在高价收购尾槌龙的驼峰"}
{"time": 1752664573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1685455893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我们的任务是驱逐，现在倒是完成任务了。\""}
{"time": 1752664619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93081647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"收集一下素材吧。\"原地思考着，\"咕..夏弥，安刚刚能飞起来一些了，你看见了吗\""}
{"time": 1752664715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "853776872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（真棒，夸夸你哦）"}
