{"time": 1752671342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148398427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2032395036]树梢的风总比林间大几分，带着些恰到好处的凉意。在这个畅快的夜晚，你暂时不必担心力竭。"}
{"time": 1752671458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700386376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1752671590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1595294671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "总算有些惬意在身上，虽然腰腹还是有些难受，但还是笑得开怀，\"夏弥...总有一天，我也要带着你去到云层之上。\""}
{"time": 1752671741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "301583261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1595294671]“啊呀，这可不是小事喔？”夏弥牵着你的手“我暂且不论，那位岚也没有几次比云更高吧？”"}
{"time": 1752671963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2022127798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=863245485]营地里的大家倒是都还没睡，觉的艾露猫不知道靠什么买通了绘梨衣帮它吐泡泡刷锅，她本人则抱着兔子在河边钓鱼"}
{"time": 1752672088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1395848026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“赫萝姐姐，刚刚我和安姐姐她们讨伐了尾锤龙，但是那尾巴和驼峰好大，感觉带不走，成熟的猎人这时候会怎么做呢”找赫萝问问"}
{"time": 1752672261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "973246182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1395848026]“蛤，你问我？”赫萝一边眉毛挑起来一边眉毛压下去“我不是猎人，你问她去，她是”她指了指觉的方向"}
{"time": 1752672340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1031029796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“抱歉抱歉，打扰打扰”有点尴尬，然后去问问觉相同的问题"}
{"time": 1752672349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1763045110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=301583261]\"诶?那我可要好好实现这个事呢？\"在月下突然有些心动\"夏弥，能吻我吗？\""}
{"time": 1752672575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411044349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1763045110]（这还没到12点呢）"}
{"time": 1752672654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1761088185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(干嘛)"}
{"time": 1752672782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294420688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1031029796]“喔，尾槌龙啊，的确是个大家伙……大家没受伤吧？”觉把兔子还到你怀里“嘛……有绳子的话，用木头做个小推车？什么的。或者……以她们的力量，给个着力点的话，应该也还拖得动吧？实在不行就……放着呗，挑重要的带走就好了，自然也需要我们这么做”"}
{"time": 1752672894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308701927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "接过兔子“谢谢觉前辈”"}
{"time": 1752672909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "38574292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙神角能用来做太刀吗）"}
{"time": 1752673078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037932805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1763045110]“这种问题可以不用问的啦……”夏弥“爬”到你身上挂住，遂你的愿，轻轻吻住你“嗯……有一点点……血味”"}
{"time": 1752673084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1884535417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=38574292]（可以）"}
{"time": 1752673262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "483704748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（+4？）"}
{"time": 1752673290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688029224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（+4吧，满足力量条件能变成+5（）"}
{"time": 1752673295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2009748444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（要求200（）"}
{"time": 1752673299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991798306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1752673577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934075762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2037932805]或许月光这时候只照着你们，树海、篝火，都入不了你的眼"}
{"time": 1752673801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "183301369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我要十分钟赶车)"}
{"time": 1752673802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "81051038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(卧槽)"}
{"time": 1752673939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "26218159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=308701927]（然后？）"}
{"time": 1752673961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "971567219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "抱着兔子回去找沧澜喽"}
{"time": 1752674008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "345368806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你之前的伤怎么样了，还需要换药吗”"}
{"time": 1752674168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897162491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2037932805]在半空中安静地停住闭上眼，在此刻，世界只有彼此和彼此的呼吸，\"嗯..\""}
{"time": 1752674243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "138107648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=345368806]“医生说还要”她点点头"}
{"time": 1752674252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311800028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "月光洒下，温柔的触感却让人久久不能忘怀，尽管如此，也嘟囔着，\"喜欢...\""}
{"time": 1752674259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "490750136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我来帮你吧”"}
{"time": 1752674579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1047406597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=311800028]“哼……为了以后还能吻到，安还是少逞能啦”她搂着你，很快就能看到营地了"}
{"time": 1752674701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539236444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=490750136]“嗯”她点点头“去哪弄？”"}
{"time": 1752674742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "883495208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就帐篷里吧，或者河边也可以”边说边找一下医生给的药"}
{"time": 1752674813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "532315695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1047406597]\"唔嗯...但是有夏弥在的话，安不会有事啦。\"真遇到事的话，我会挡在前面，如此想着不由得点了点脑袋，伸手解开头发，\"呼...回营地咯。\"驭使风载着二人缓缓降落到营地中央。"}
{"time": 1752674983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1872862488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=883495208]“听你的”"}
{"time": 1752675057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1466814623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那就去河边吧”带上药和绷带，牵起沧澜的手“我们走？”"}
{"time": 1752675286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1993242366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1466814623]“走吧”沧澜卸下背上的素材，跟着你走"}
{"time": 1752675315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1966721421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=532315695]营地里，觉还在垂钓，餐具倒是基本收拾好了。沧澜和露儿在向外走"}
{"time": 1752675511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "296841661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不打扰沧澜和露儿，倚着夏弥的手臂，一脸餍足的迷离表情，舔舔嘴唇，没注意自己不自觉的表情，走到觉旁边轻声开口，\"小觉，赫萝和绘梨衣去哪里了？\""}
{"time": 1752675560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1232599420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（呃）"}
{"time": 1752675565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210003955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（并非不在）"}
{"time": 1752675619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1767529728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "带着沧澜沿着小溪走到一处比较亮且四处无人的地方"}
{"time": 1752675621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1310330400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（见上条）"}
{"time": 1752675679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "305635738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=296841661]“一个在那边发呆，一个在那边逗猫，真是惬意。看起来今晚收获不错？”"}
{"time": 1752675732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "220846867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1767529728]你和沧澜走到一处树荫不多的河边，附近自然是哪都没人"}
{"time": 1752675756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2006385523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个...把衣服脱了吧”有点脸红"}
{"time": 1752675785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1691278463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"当然！\"左手一只手指勾到嘴唇前擦擦，看着她看着自己想到刚刚的事顿时有些脸红，\"咳咳...毕竟尾锤龙是很有价值的猎物。\""}
{"time": 1752675987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250246063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "同时不同地，你们面对的人对你们问出同一个问题"}
{"time": 1752675990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1106105381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“脸红什么？”"}
{"time": 1752676109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660697081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没什么，没什么，总之你先背对着我把衣服脱了吧”"}
{"time": 1752676144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2111650160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没..没没什么...\"放开夏弥慌慌张张地跑远，掐掐自己的脸，深呼吸调整心情，去看看赫萝在干嘛"}
{"time": 1752676163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2075436835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1660697081]她倒是不用你解释就已经开始脱了"}
{"time": 1752676464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1601876057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2111650160]大概吃饱喝足了在发呆，看着已经有点困了"}
{"time": 1752676542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1716506422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（她伤口处是不是现在缠着绷带的）"}
{"time": 1752676651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64553084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2075436835]脊背依旧光洁，在月亮的冷光下也有些发亮。身侧的伤口糊着药膏，纱布以胶带固定，没有裹满全身"}
{"time": 1752676666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1058134360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自己还有些精神，虽然因为受伤的原因实际上很虚。对着她伸出手，轻声开口，\"走，我带你去休息\""}
{"time": 1752676684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1765907693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1058134360]（那你想好怎么分了吗）"}
{"time": 1752676692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42157118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我睡外面呗)"}
{"time": 1752676703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "54470515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(主动请缨去沙发)"}
