{"time": 1752676761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "627901660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（理想情况下只要大家都不介意的话）"}
{"time": 1752676783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910467695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（就是你把一个帐篷里的人叫醒，然后你睡帐篷里）"}
{"time": 1752676794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1536590388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=627901660]（就是有人介意啊）"}
{"time": 1752676799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "334448914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(肯定有人介意啊)"}
{"time": 1752676830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "960619164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(待会再说，我先主动请缨去沙发)"}
{"time": 1752676876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127172917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "搓搓自己的手吹口气，防止手太冰，小心的拆纱布“可能有点疼，你稍微忍一下”"}
{"time": 1752676973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1853958115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1058134360]“嗯？哦……”她像鸟一样眨眨眼，跟着你站起来"}
{"time": 1752677042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1907745145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2127172917]“不碍事，习惯了。而且现在已经不会疼了”"}
{"time": 1752677111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "157212562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1853958115]脸色红潮散去，扶住她，带着她往帐篷走，路上小声慢慢开口，\"安现在也能飞起来了哦，说不定以后就能和赫萝比一比速度了。\"露出个天真无邪的笑"}
{"time": 1752677150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1303032128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的吗，疼的话一定要告诉我”继续拆"}
{"time": 1752677394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649425888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=157212562]“会飞……你？”她似乎醒了些“哦，想起来了。不过想追上我，还是想想就好，不可能的”"}
{"time": 1752677767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1052822354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1303032128]她没有回答，静静地等你拆完。你总是忍不住想象她没受伤的样子"}
{"time": 1752677802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970391306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看伤怎么样了"}
{"time": 1752677917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "518482996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1649425888]\"干什么嘛，等到那一天，一定要试一试。\"把她带到帐篷前，揉揉脑袋，\"去睡吧，安为你们守夜。\""}
{"time": 1752677997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2038706953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=970391306]血痂已经开始脱落，露出底下新生但还未成熟的粉红肉皮。皮下看得出带着点点血斑，看起来会很敏感，很难说会不会留疤"}
{"time": 1752678097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1663099083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拿出酒精先给伤口消消毒“可恶的家伙，居然在沧澜身上留下这种伤口，等我以后变强大了一定会帮你报仇的”"}
{"time": 1752678168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1438566943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=518482996]“哦……”赫萝无所谓地耸耸肩，这位也是个学不会客气的主，就往帐篷里钻“随你怎么想。但我是你就不会这么想”"}
{"time": 1752678241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629957297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不试试怎么知道，到时候再奉陪啦。\"吐吐舌头，\"安也许很厉害也说不定。\""}
{"time": 1752678366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "675102269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1663099083]“要报仇也会是我先吧”沧澜依旧把背挺得笔直“我也会变强”"}
{"time": 1752678464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "566844205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=629957297]“好啊”声音从帐篷里传出，有些朦胧“随时奉……陪”"}
{"time": 1752678467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "856423364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，到时候我们一起去”伤口擦的差不多了“不过沧澜，你皮肤好好啊”偷偷摸一下背上没有伤的地方"}
{"time": 1752678571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634670212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"晚安。\"揉一揉自己的腰腹，去看看绘梨衣，\"哟...绘梨衣大人被什么收买了?在这里吐泡泡\""}
{"time": 1752678673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "660872862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=856423364]（没回答过（）"}
{"time": 1752678681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "154580846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有没有高手）"}
{"time": 1752678858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1756088790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我不知道）"}
