{"time": 1752679078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828124933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=856423364]她不说话了，大概是不知道怎么回答，半天才憋出来“差不多吧”"}
{"time": 1752679251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309652980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“复完仇之后你有什么想做的吗”"}
{"time": 1752679351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64389576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=634670212]“毛茸茸和毛茸茸，怎么了，你们都习惯让这么可爱的小家伙自己干活吗？”绘梨衣绕了绕头发"}
{"time": 1752679419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "679341152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1309652980]“可能和之前一样，也可能和现在一样。我还没想过”"}
{"time": 1752679553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590233510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=64389576]\"嘛...这种事你要问白咯。\"笑眯眯地蹲下来，\"嘶..\"腹部还是有些疼，忍住，把自家的白抱起来顺毛，\"siro，你来回答她吧？\""}
{"time": 1752679590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2023651528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以继续和我一起吗...”"}
{"time": 1752679871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501861324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1590233510]（哎，无孩爱猫女）"}
