{"time": 1752680333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "614765343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(所以我回答不了啊)"}
{"time": 1752680504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1860623297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1590233510]“不是喵，安会帮白的忙，给白买好多衣服和木天蓼喵~而且和安一起，白很开心喵～”"}
{"time": 1752680509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "147868729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，太变态了）"}
{"time": 1752680601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338199670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"对吧对吧。\"手指逗着白的下巴，贴着脸蹭蹭"}
{"time": 1752680620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "551409683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2023651528]“那就是和现在一样”"}
{"time": 1752680703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "187938596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1338199670]“嘛，真是心思单纯好满足的生物”绘梨衣一手撑着下巴，一手伸出来捏捏白的耳朵“比人可爱多了”"}
{"time": 1752680857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "996368316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“现在这样就挺好的...”"}
{"time": 1752680863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "564425116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=551409683]（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 所以你还上药吗）"}
{"time": 1752680878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "582155847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "开始抹药"}
{"time": 1752680912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "484542932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "小心的蘸些药在伤口上轻轻的涂抹“稍微忍一下...”"}
{"time": 1752681092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069610381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=187938596]\"干嘛啦?像是话里有话的样子。\"抬头看着她，\"难道安不可爱?\""}
{"time": 1752681200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1538239553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=484542932]总之沧澜非常稳定地上完了药，只能说虚惊一场（吗，并没有惊）"}
{"time": 1752681356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1761775569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2069610381]“比酒馆里大声嚷嚷的和莫名其妙上来问名字的稍好些”她只和你对视了半秒，就又回去rua白"}
{"time": 1752681508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "82565365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随后用绷带绑住"}
{"time": 1752681519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1029837371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯好了，你可以把衣服穿上了”"}
{"time": 1752681601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785668010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1761775569]\"切，分明就很可爱吧。\"因为恢复伤势的原因有些困倦，抱着白就近坐下，眼睛有些睁不开"}
{"time": 1752681807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "884144638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1029837371]“嗯……我先试试”她没有先去拿衣服，而是先把盔甲叫了出来。身侧不至于空出来但只有一层软膜。确认之后，她才又把衣服穿上“好了，现在回去？”"}
