{"time": 1752681923, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1486278628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]演奏出: 1D2=2"}
{"time": 1752681937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336309984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，沧澜还有什么想做的事吗，没有就回去休息吧”"}
{"time": 1752681971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1586623052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之绘梨衣看你把白抱走，便打了个哈欠，随后往觉搭起来的帐篷里走了"}
{"time": 1752682005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1392432644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1336309984]“我是没有。那个，尾槌龙的尸体，你之前不是还说”"}
{"time": 1752682040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "262337013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“什么[CQ:face,id=32,raw=&#91;object Object&#93;][CQ:face,id=32,raw=&#91;object Object&#93;][CQ:face,id=32,raw=&#91;object Object&#93;]”"}
{"time": 1752682119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "690532555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“素材，什么的”"}
{"time": 1752682123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351815689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1586623052]知道今晚大概是没有床睡了，抱着晃晃悠悠走到觉旁边，\"小觉...感觉今晚我们要睡外面了\""}
{"time": 1752682167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1963931300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我们去把那个尾巴给带回来吧，那个应该能卖不少钱，驼峰感觉有点难带回来了”"}
{"time": 1752682176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1473213155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1351815689]“啊？为什么？”觉刚空军一杆"}
{"time": 1752682237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "756655142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1963931300]（哎，我教你）"}
{"time": 1752682271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2104787524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你看驼峰肉比尾巴肉值钱，尾巴壳比驼峰壳值钱）"}
{"time": 1752682307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1855545695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（挖了（）"}
{"time": 1752682316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "736419163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打个哈欠，顺势靠到夏弥怀里，\"那两家伙一人钻了个帐篷啦...呼喵\""}
{"time": 1752682340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1575817617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实一个帐篷能睡两个人（）"}
{"time": 1752682449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "759498179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=736419163]“哦真可惜……哎，动作真快啊”觉喃喃“听起来今晚得我们守夜了，还是尽量轮班吧”"}
{"time": 1752682541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "489878227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2104787524]（厉害[CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1752682547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "446436489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好像有点道理）"}
{"time": 1752682565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810640500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那走吧，继续去处理素材吧”"}
{"time": 1752682602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539867536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=810640500]“嗯，那走吧”"}
{"time": 1752682658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1003619794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...呼..\"躺在夏弥怀里几乎睁不开眼睛了，自然也没怎么听清觉在说什么，\"哎嘿嘿...好香...\"皱了皱眉，\"肚子..疼..\""}
{"time": 1752682887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "661033919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=539867536]总之你们又回到尸体旁边，已经有鸟儿和小狗龙来蚕食尾槌龙破破烂烂的尸体了"}
{"time": 1752683085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107638091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1003619794]“嗯……”觉从包里拿出两个小罐，一个是驱蚊熏香，一个大概是跌打药酒。她把后者递给夏弥“这个，涂在伤处——有流血就别涂了。往一边揉，别用多少力气，揉到发热就行”"}
{"time": 1752683424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2121504313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...唔..\""}
{"time": 1752683472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308576417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "开挖，把尾巴里的肉挖出来"}
{"time": 1752683501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1018570603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1107638091]“谢谢……觉也去休息吧？我……”“没事，我今天下午睡过一觉了，也没怎么活动。知道你是铁打的，但是总得休息会……一人守一半吧”觉又抛出一杆"}
{"time": 1752683591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "753695685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=308576417]尾巴里的肉比你想象的少一些，或者说甲壳比你想象的厚一些。总之没费多少功夫"}
{"time": 1752683596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1751244943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是你没买绳子啊）"}
