{"time": 1752683881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1288455441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后去取驼峰肉，用小袋子分装起来然后往尾巴里塞"}
{"time": 1752683978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1908716939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=865649469]“还好吧”觉摆摆手“我不讨厌这样。虽然不一定帮上的人都会谢我……不过会的总是占多数。现在我本来也……不缺什么”"}
{"time": 1752683995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "161502784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1288455441]（为什么要分装（）"}
