{"time": 1752684812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1804904094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "虽然不知道球怎么扛，但反正你们扛回来了，回来之后发现三个人一横两竖呆在溪流旁，夏弥空不出手来，所以觉给你们比的噤声手势"}
{"time": 1752685031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026409693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "皱着的眉头逐渐舒开，\"唔...\"晚风吹过有些冷，下意识地把手搭在自己敞着的肚子上，已经完全睡下"}
{"time": 1752685144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208797013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
