{"time": 1752685343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1235763451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（暂时没有做梦的契机（）"}
{"time": 1752685365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "516964228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，次日，清晨"}
{"time": 1752685408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1729548533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "觉在营地里走了两三圈，把你们各自叫醒"}
{"time": 1752685413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "713132833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "伸个懒腰起床了，昨晚和沧澜睡在一起，应该没有做什么出格的举动吧"}
{"time": 1752685434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "443582474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我怎么知道，按理说有睡袋的）"}
{"time": 1752685449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741081743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "睁开眼，昨晚好像是突然昏迷，只记到夏弥在附近，也不清楚睡在哪里"}
{"time": 1752685638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700609156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=741081743]你发现你枕在夏弥腿上，面朝她的小肚子。她看起来也刚醒，不过是坐着睡的"}
{"time": 1752685693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240642675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=713132833]沧澜也揉了揉眼睛，从睡袋里爬出来“早上好……”"}
{"time": 1752685746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594559692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“早”然后去河边洗漱"}
{"time": 1752685830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "169810336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"转个身想要爬起来"}
{"time": 1752685855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1139825563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=169810336]至少腹肌已经几乎不痛了"}
{"time": 1752685936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1356828749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"夏弥，唔..腿麻了吗？\"动的有些慢，\"我给你揉一揉。\""}
{"time": 1752685945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1333028383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1594559692]此外你确实很少见到沧澜刚醒的样子，这时候的表情比清醒的时候丰富多了，皱着眉眯着眼，一副想回笼的样子"}
{"time": 1752685989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "331894226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好可爱”忍不住上去捏下她的脸"}
{"time": 1752686084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821989191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1356828749]“没有，安没那么重啦……”夏弥也轻轻打个哈欠，尽力没张嘴"}
{"time": 1752686108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "435099620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=331894226]“嗯……别……”沧澜的眉头皱得更深了"}
{"time": 1752686157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1624620481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“oh，抱歉抱歉，没忍住”把手收回来“要不你捏捏我的”"}
{"time": 1752686274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "246570696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1624620481]她没回答你，脑袋一低像是又睡着了"}
{"time": 1752686306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1469671009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=821989191]\"那作为报答，我也要好好揉一揉呢。\"起身，蹲在她脚边，伸手帮她揉揉大腿"}
{"time": 1752686307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702689924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小瞌睡虫，没想到你也有这样的一面啊”"}
{"time": 1752686375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811056927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1469671009]（哎，痴女）"}
{"time": 1752686412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1550223364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(都结婚了怎么算)"}
{"time": 1752686443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1327264025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=702689924]总之大概确实是睡着了"}
{"time": 1752686480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1767894354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1469671009]\"夏弥要是愿意的话，以后每一天都可以哦。\"虽然因为睡在外面精神也没有很好，但还是很努力打起精神让自己显得有些元气"}
{"time": 1752686484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "343460149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1469671009]“嗯……有点痒啦……安昨晚睡得怎么样？”"}
{"time": 1752686488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "437515811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "让她多睡会吧，去河边洗把脸去"}
{"time": 1752686535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688251825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1767894354]（每一天都可以干嘛）"}
{"time": 1752686589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697933481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(按摩吧)"}
{"time": 1752686650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1940396430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一般来说大腿不太适合按摩（）"}
{"time": 1752686653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040240620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=343460149]\"唔...感觉最开始有点痒?后面肚子那里忽冷忽热的...\"头发有些散，几缕飘到了眼前"}
{"time": 1752686661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "931787485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（因为按不动也没什么在这里的肌肉）"}
{"time": 1752686661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1027075282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没限定大腿)"}
{"time": 1752686708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112895739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=437515811]早晨的溪水格外冷冽，激得你一下睡意全无"}
{"time": 1752687062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208444480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2040240620]“嘛……总之现在感觉怎么样？”夏弥眨眨眼，纤长的睫毛蝴蝶一般忽闪"}
{"time": 1752687088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "962064486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嘶，有点冷”"}
{"time": 1752687252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1291708913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=208444480]忍不住探起脑袋，额头抵着她的额头，闭着眼睛睫毛交错，蹭一蹭然后退开，颇有活力站在她面前比个耶，\"清早就汲取了这么多夏弥能量，这不是状态绝佳吗？\"虽然因此散落在额前的头发更多了"}
{"time": 1752687293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1092760245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你是真的写意"}
{"time": 1752687305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "985670835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过我总感觉该在昨晚断章）"}
{"time": 1752687320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "166168845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（因为不知道为什么我好困）"}
{"time": 1752687340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677690083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1752687360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "144070105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好困往往是在过度劳累之后）"}
{"time": 1752687476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "740099040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(为什么)"}
